# chapter4.rpyc:36
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ade76882:

    # Merel "Phew! Today sure went in an interestin’ direction, but I can’t say that I’m upset about it!"
    Merel "呼！今天的发展真有意思，不过我可一点都不后悔！"

# chapter4.rpyc:38
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b51c8338:

    # Merel "I had a lot of fun, actually, tryin’ on that fancy dress, even if getting into it was a bit of a pain."
    Merel "其实，试穿那条华丽裙子特别好玩，虽然穿进去是费了点劲。"

# chapter4.rpyc:40
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4b320f4b:

    # Merel "Still, I should be used to that, after workin’ at Fleur de Lys for so long! So!"
    Merel "不过，在百合花干了这么久，也该习惯啦！所以！"

# chapter4.rpyc:42
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_75dce3c9:

    # Merel "What do you think, Niene? Didja have a good time?"
    Merel "妮妮，你呢？今天玩得开心吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:44
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_69125667:

    # Nienke "Oh, um..."
    Nienke "啊，嗯……"

# chapter4.rpyc:48
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_07eaf95e:

    # "I glance at Merel from beneath my eyelashes, my arms wound around my legs."
    "我抱着双腿，从睫毛下悄悄看她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:55
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6d7017c0:

    # "Both of us are sitting on the grass, beneath the starry sky."
    "我们都坐在星空下的草地上。"

# chapter4.rpyc:56
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c5bca61e:

    # "We’ve since finished with our impromptu photo shoot, and now we’re outdoors, simply enjoying the atmosphere."
    "临时起意的拍摄已经结束，这会儿，只是在户外享受周围的宁静。"

# chapter4.rpyc:57
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_89fdb058:

    # "It’s been over a half hour since I removed that wedding dress, and changed into my typical attire, but I can still remember how that veil felt against my skin."
    "脱下婚纱，换回平时的衣服，已经半个多小时。可头纱贴着皮肤的触感，还记得清楚。"

# chapter4.rpyc:58
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c7c047ec:

    # "The veil might have been made of a thin, gossamer sort of fabric, but there was a lot of it, and it weighed on me."
    "那布料虽然薄得像蛛丝，层层叠叠起来，却也有分量。"

# chapter4.rpyc:59
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6e0e0ebd:

    # "I swear I can still feel the bite of the silvery clips, meanwhile, which held that veil in place."
    "固定头纱的银色发夹，夹着头发的感觉，好像也还在。"

# chapter4.rpyc:60
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_30bb2a10:

    # "I feel almost exposed now I’m no longer wearing that long, full skirt: almost vulnerable. I wonder if that’s because I remembered my old promise with Merel."
    "没了那条又长又蓬的裙子，反而觉得有点无所遮蔽，甚至脆弱。是因为想起跟梅蕾尔的旧约定吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:61
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_377a6801:

    # "I didn’t remember Merel for the longest time, but some fragments of my past have finally returned to me."
    "那么久都不记得她，可过去的一些碎片，终于回来了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:62
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_89adc2bd:

    # "Merel has always looked out for me. She even told me that she loved me..."
    "她一直保护着我，甚至说过爱我……"

# chapter4.rpyc:63
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_04ea6d8f:

    # "And now, I know that I love her."
    "而现在，我知道自己也爱她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:64
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7f458868:

    # "I’m glad that she came into my life. My days have certainly brightened since Merel appeared in them, and I want to tell her as much."
    "很高兴她闯进我的生活。自从有了她，日子确实明亮了许多。我想把这些告诉她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:65
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_189a79bc:

    # "I’ve been pretty sparing with my praise, but I think she deserves it."
    "一直很吝啬夸奖，可她值得。"

# chapter4.rpyc:76
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f14ee6c5:

    # Nienke "It...{w} wasn’t bad, yeah."
    Nienke "嗯……{w}还不错。"

# chapter4.rpyc:77
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4030044f:

    # "I reply, after a brief pause."
    "短暂的停顿后，我答道。"

# chapter4.rpyc:79
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_26866554:

    # Nienke "In fact, there was something kind of nostalgic about it..."
    Nienke "其实，还有点怀念的感觉……"

# chapter4.rpyc:81
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f5b10810:

    # Merel "Nostalgic?"
    Merel "怀念？"

# chapter4.rpyc:83
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5fe1432c:

    # Nienke "Mm. It made me remember something I’ve not thought about in a while."
    Nienke "嗯。让我想起了很久没想过的事。"

# chapter4.rpyc:85
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_912f6040:

    # Nienke "It made me think of a promise we made..."
    Nienke "想起我们做过的一个约定……"

# chapter4.rpyc:87
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e372d9e1:

    # Nienke "But that was a very long time ago."
    Nienke "不过，已经是很久以前了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:89
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a3ac0167:

    # Nienke "I’m surprised you remember it too."
    Nienke "你居然也记得，挺意外的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:92
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d353cc18:

    # Merel "Well, of course I remember it! That promise was very, very important to me, you know?"
    Merel "当然记得！那个约定对我非常、非常重要，知道吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:94
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_269f640f:

    # Nienke "I, um, did get that impression, yes..."
    Nienke "嗯，这个……有感觉到……"

# chapter4.rpyc:98
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c0078f6c:

    # "I inhale, the breeze cool on my tongue; in my throat."
    "我吸了一口气，凉风掠过舌尖和喉咙。"

# chapter4.rpyc:100
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1ff4e3b6:

    # "Slowly, I blink, my head bowed, then mumble..."
    "低着头，慢慢眨了眨眼，轻声说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:101
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a05d03b4:

    # Nienke "A-And it’s important to me, too."
    Nienke "对、对我也很重要。"

# chapter4.rpyc:103
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_405bdaf2:

    # Merel "It is?"
    Merel "真的？"

# chapter4.rpyc:104
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2f10672b:

    # "Merel gasps, her red eyes widening."
    "她轻轻吸气，睁大红眼睛。"

# chapter4.rpyc:105
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_364016d7:

    # Merel "How much of our promise do you remember, exactly?"
    Merel "那个约定，你到底想起多少？"

# chapter4.rpyc:107
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d3df1308:

    # Nienke "...Enough of it, I guess. I know that I asked to... W-Well... M-M-Marry you..."
    Nienke "……该记得的，都记得吧。我知道，是我提出要……嗯……跟、跟你结婚……"

# chapter4.rpyc:109
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_17712755:

    # "I make myself mumble, though I can’t stop stammering: tripping over my Ms like a stuck typewriter."
    "我逼自己低声说出来，却结巴个不停，像卡住的打字机。"

# chapter4.rpyc:111
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_12e0c7ae:

    # Nienke "...a-and I know that you agreed to it."
    Nienke "……也、也知道你答应了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:113
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6dcb71e0:

    # Nienke "I know, at the time, th-this promise was very important to me...{w} but I forgot it."
    Nienke "那时，这、这个约定对我很重要……{w}可我却忘了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:114
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_113090a6:

    # Nienke "I forgot so many things after I fell sick. I forgot all about Mors Paravail, and about you..."
    Nienke "生病后，忘了太多东西。莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，还有你，全都忘了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:116
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_70784726:

    # Nienke "But I guess you never did?"
    Nienke "可你一直没忘，是吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:118
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0db0b4f7:

    # Merel "Of course not. I never could forget you, little Niene. You’ve always been precious to me, and you’ll keep on being precious to me, no matter what happens."
    Merel "当然没有。小妮妮，我怎么会忘记你？你一直是我珍惜的人，以后也是，不管发生什么。"

# chapter4.rpyc:122
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_10ec79e0:

    # Merel "I’m...{w} real glad you remembered our wedding vows, even if they were exchanged between a couple of dumb kids."
    Merel "你能想起我们的结婚誓言，我……{w}真的很高兴。哪怕只是两个傻孩子之间的约定。"

# chapter4.rpyc:123
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c3e00596:

    # Merel "It... lets me know that this wasn’t all a dream on my part."
    Merel "至少让我知道，那不是我一个人做的梦。"

# chapter4.rpyc:125
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a7fea2f4:

    # Merel "It was hard for me to know, y’know, since you were the only person present during our vows, an’ you didn’t even remember me, much less anythin’ I said to you!"
    Merel "毕竟当时只有我们两个在场。你连我都不记得，更别说我讲过什么，有时候真的很难确定！"

# chapter4.rpyc:126
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c197efdb:

    # Merel "There was somethin’ kinda lonely about it, actually: hangin’ on to all of these memories, while you couldn’t recall any of them."
    Merel "其实有点孤单。一个人守着那么多回忆，你却一点都想不起来。"

# chapter4.rpyc:128
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b0c11a4e:

    # Merel "It made me wonder if I might’ve been mistaken after all..."
    Merel "忍不住怀疑，会不会是我自己弄错了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:130
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_39e6b1d3:

    # Merel "But if you remember it all too, that means it must’ve been real!"
    Merel "可既然你也记得，那就证明一定是真的！"

# chapter4.rpyc:132
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_29501a3d:

    # Nienke "Yes, I suppose it does — unless we’re both sharing the same delusion, of course."
    Nienke "嗯，应该是。除非，我们两个恰好有同一种妄想。"

# chapter4.rpyc:134
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1eff67c8:

    # Merel "Wahaha! Now, that really would be somethin’! I dunno how likely it is, though."
    Merel "哇哈哈！那可真稀奇！不过，这种事可能性不大吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:136
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_db4112a8:

    # Merel "Life tends to be more straightforward than that."
    Merel "日子一般没那么复杂。"

# chapter4.rpyc:140
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_dfce8055:

    # Merel "I’m sure our vows happened. They must’ve, else I wouldn’t remember them so clearly, an’ I’m sure you wouldn’t, either."
    Merel "约定肯定是真的。不然我不会记得那么清楚，你也不会。"

# chapter4.rpyc:142
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_91c3d4a6:

    # Merel "I never thought we’d have the chance to make good on them, but... Hehe."
    Merel "没想到还有机会兑现，可是……嘿嘿。"

# chapter4.rpyc:144
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fff66ea4:

    # "Merel giggles, then leans back. She rests her palms on the grass, her fingers splayed, and looks up at the night sky."
    "她咯咯笑着，向后靠，双手张开放在草地上，抬头望星空。"

# chapter4.rpyc:146
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4f99c725:

    # Merel "I guess things worked out in the end after all. I’m glad I was able to find you again..."
    Merel "看来，最后还是圆满了。真高兴又找到了你……"

# chapter4.rpyc:148
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c1e4c6a0:

    # Merel "And, though I might be goin’ back to Mors Paravail tomorrow, this isn’t the end. I promise I’ll keep in touch this time — since you actually remember me, that is."
    Merel "虽然明天就要回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，可这不是结束。这次保证会跟你联系，毕竟你真的想起我了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:152
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_40adebcb:

    # Merel "I’ll write to you, Niene, and I’ll tell you what I’m doing..."
    Merel "妮妮，我会写信给你，告诉你每天在做什么……"

# chapter4.rpyc:154
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c5fb933d:

    # Merel "And maybe I can come and visit you again?"
    Merel "也许，还能再来看你？"

# chapter4.rpyc:155
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a1f5bdd6:

    # "Merel’s smiling when she says this, but there’s a note of hesitation in her voice."
    "说这话时，她在笑，声音里却有一丝迟疑。"

# chapter4.rpyc:159
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_feff430e:

    # "Is she worried that I won’t respond to this inquiry positively?"
    "是在担心，我不会给个肯定的答复？"

# chapter4.rpyc:160
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_219bf202:

    # "Maybe she’s afraid that I no longer want anything to do with her, and I consider our time together in Alpenrose nothing more than a fleeting moment of madness."
    "怕我不想再跟她有关系，觉得在阿尔彭罗瑟的这段相处，只是一时昏头？"

# chapter4.rpyc:162
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9f0fbab9:

    # "I wasn’t all that nice to her when she first came here. I can understand if she feels a little uncertain about our relationship now: unsure of its future, or whether it even has one..."
    "刚来时，我对她确实不好。如今她会拿不准这段关系，拿不准以后怎样，甚至有没有以后，也能理解……"

# chapter4.rpyc:164
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fde4a14d:

    # "But on that score, at least, I want to reassure her."
    "可至少在这一点上，我想让她放心。"

# chapter4.rpyc:166
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6da05b9f:

    # "I think it would be nice to spend more time with her."
    "能再多陪她一些日子，会很好。"

# chapter4.rpyc:168
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7483a215:

    # "That’s a woefully inadequate word to describe the full depth of my feelings, of course, but..."
    "当然，“很好”远远不够形容全部的感情。可是……"

# chapter4.rpyc:170
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ddbe1a67:

    # Nienke "...I think I’d like that."
    Nienke "……我想，我会很高兴。"

# chapter4.rpyc:174
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_79ae6901:

    # Nienke "Being with you made Alpenrose feel more...{w} vibrant, somehow. You made me appreciate the little things I’ve never really noticed before."
    Nienke "跟你在一起，阿尔彭罗瑟好像变得更……{w}鲜活了。那些从前没注意过的小事，也开始觉得可爱。"

# chapter4.rpyc:176
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2778ee84:

    # Nienke "Maybe you could even say that you opened my eyes."
    Nienke "甚至可以说，是你让我重新睁开了眼睛。"

# chapter4.rpyc:178
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_37a907d1:

    # Nienke "You made me see everything I was missing out on. The village was a lot prettier when you walked around it with me, so... Yeah."
    Nienke "让我看见了以前错过的东西。有你陪着逛，这座村子漂亮多了。所以，嗯。"

# chapter4.rpyc:180
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ee4a3069:

    # Nienke "I’d like it if you came back. You’d be welcome here any time."
    Nienke "希望你再来。这里随时欢迎你。"

# chapter4.rpyc:182
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a8eda9fc:

    # Merel "Even if I have to sleep in your room again?"
    Merel "就算还得睡你房间里？"

# chapter4.rpyc:186
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6dd49f41:

    # Merel "I know you didn’t really like that, hehe: not in the beginning, at least. You were adamantly against it, even!"
    Merel "我知道你不太喜欢，嘿嘿。至少一开始不喜欢，还反对得很坚决呢！"

# chapter4.rpyc:188
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d983a586:

    # Merel "Wasn’t I getting in your way: invading your personal space? In the beginning, you even suggested that I sleep on the floor!"
    Merel "不是嫌我碍事，侵占私人空间吗？一开始还建议我睡地板！"

# chapter4.rpyc:192
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b6e5bcd4:

    # Nienke "W-Well, that was in the beginning, like you said!"
    Nienke "那、那是一开始，你也说了！"

# chapter4.rpyc:193
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5015256a:

    # Nienke "I don’t think it’s fair to hit me with the things I said to you when you first came here. I was in a bad mood because it felt like you were invading my privacy..."
    Nienke "老拿你刚来时的话堵我，不公平。那时候心情不好，觉得私人空间被闯进来了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:195
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_561fa76f:

    # Nienke "And you {i}did{/i} invade my privacy in the beginning, remember?"
    Nienke "而且，你一开始{i}确实{/i}闯进来了，记得吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:196
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a8390e85:

    # Nienke "You were really insistent on sleeping in my bed, even though we were still strangers — or, at least, that’s how it felt."
    Nienke "明明还算陌生人，至少在我看来是，你却非要睡我的床。"

# chapter4.rpyc:198
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_edf24798:

    # Nienke "I didn’t remember you at all, but you were determined to pick up the threads of our friendship like nothing had happened!"
    Nienke "我完全不记得你，你倒一心想像什么都没发生过一样，继续以前的友情！"

# chapter4.rpyc:200
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_07e9ba15:

    # Nienke "I think it’s perfectly reasonable that I felt a little put out, you were being so pushy. I’m sure anybody would’ve felt the same way I did: any normal person, at least."
    Nienke "你那么咄咄逼人，我不高兴，很正常吧。换成谁都会一样，至少正常人都会。"

# chapter4.rpyc:202
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_59746178:

    # Nienke "You weren’t being very considerate!"
    Nienke "你一点都不体贴！"

# chapter4.rpyc:205
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9e633698:

    # Merel "And yet, despite my apparent lack of consideration, you still wanna spend more time with me? I must’ve made an impression, wahaha!"
    Merel "可这么不体贴，你还是想多陪我？看来，我确实留下了深刻印象，哇哈哈！"

# chapter4.rpyc:209
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0e8ee839:

    # Merel "You were so cold to me in the beginning, I was afraid we’d never be able to see eye-to-eye. I was seriously freakin’ out that we’d never be friends again..."
    Merel "刚开始那么冷，我都怕我们永远没法好好相处了，真担心再也做不成朋友……"

# chapter4.rpyc:211
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0bea5e0f:

    # Merel "So I’m glad my persistence paid off. Now, you can’t get enough of me!"
    Merel "幸好坚持有用。现在，你都离不开我啦！"

# chapter4.rpyc:215
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_99dfd44d:

    # Nienke "I wouldn’t push my luck if I were you. You can still go too far sometimes: especially with that ridiculous book."
    Nienke "换成我，就不会这么得寸进尺。你有时候还是太过分，尤其那本荒唐的书。"

# chapter4.rpyc:217
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c277aa06:

    # Nienke "I’m not sure why you were so excited about it, or why you were so determined to show me it..."
    Nienke "不知道你为什么那么兴奋，又为什么非给我看不可……"

# chapter4.rpyc:219
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_132f1051:

    # Merel "Well, of course I wanted to show you it! It was funny!"
    Merel "当然要给你看，好玩呀！"

# chapter4.rpyc:221
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_344f6631:

    # Nienke "And, even now, it seems like you don’t regret what you did at all!"
    Nienke "到现在都还一点不后悔，是吧！"

# chapter4.rpyc:225
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_33f0da78:

    # Nienke "Did you really show me something indecent solely so you could make me blush?"
    Nienke "给我看那么不正经的东西，就为了让我脸红？"

# chapter4.rpyc:226
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ad21bfe8:

    # Merel "Not exactly. I really did think it’d be funny."
    Merel "也不全是，我真的觉得好玩。"

# chapter4.rpyc:228
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f58e0802:

    # Merel "I didn’t realise you’d have such an intense response to it..."
    Merel "没想到你反应那么大……"

# chapter4.rpyc:230
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d6ddb248:

    # Merel "But that was pretty cute in its own way! I’m glad I was able to make you blush!"
    Merel "不过，那样也挺可爱的！能逗你脸红，我很高兴！"

# chapter4.rpyc:232
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9ea77920:

    # Nienke "A-As if you need to make any great attempts to do that."
    Nienke "说、说得好像你需要费多大劲似的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:236
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_03c07242:

    # Nienke "I seem to blush all of the time, no matter what you say and do. It’s aggravating."
    Nienke "不管你说什么、做什么，我好像都会脸红。烦死了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:238
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_aba2de7f:

    # Merel "I had noticed that, yeah. You turn red so easy: practically at the drop of a hat..."
    Merel "嗯，注意到了。你太容易红，简直一逗就红……"

# chapter4.rpyc:240
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e39ccd4a:

    # Merel "But that’s another one of the reasons why I like you so much!"
    Merel "可这也是我这么喜欢你的原因之一！"

# chapter4.rpyc:242
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7219333f:

    # Nienke "D-Do you really like me...?"
    Nienke "真、真的喜欢我……？"

# chapter4.rpyc:244
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1feb6e4f:

    # Merel "Yes! I like you a lot! You’re very, very precious to me."
    Merel "真的！特别喜欢！你对我非常、非常重要。"

# chapter4.rpyc:246
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bc60494b:

    # Merel "I was worryin’ you never would remember me, and we wouldn’t get along..."
    Merel "原本还担心，你永远想不起我，我们也处不好……"

# chapter4.rpyc:248
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b1344b3e:

    # Merel "But it seems like I didn’t need to fuss so much!"
    Merel "看来，不用那么操心啦！"

# chapter4.rpyc:250
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_464afb60:

    # Merel "You’ve made a huge recovery. You’re nothin’ like the weak, feeble girl you were before you left Mors Paravail."
    Merel "你恢复得那么好，跟离开莫尔斯·帕拉维尔前那个虚弱的小女孩，完全不一样。"

# chapter4.rpyc:252
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_854fb25a:

    # Merel "You’re positively brimmin’ with energy, though I dunno if you can match my enthusiasm."
    Merel "精神饱满，虽然热情上大概还是比不过我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:254
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d657b5b8:

    # Merel "Still, that might be a bit of a high bar to reach!"
    Merel "不过，这个要求可能有点高！"

# chapter4.rpyc:256
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_37422a0a:

    # Merel "I know there ain’t all that many people out there who’re as energetic as I am! I worry I might wear you down, actually, if you keep hangin’ out with me..."
    Merel "毕竟像我这么有活力的人，没几个！真有点怕，你一直陪我，会被累垮……"

# chapter4.rpyc:257
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_002328ab:

    # Merel "But d’you think you can handle it?"
    Merel "应付得来吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:259
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e3e96274:

    # Nienke "I am certain I will be fine. I am not weak or feeble, like you said, and neither am I a girl. I am a fully grown elf, and I am more than capable of fending for myself."
    Nienke "当然没问题。就像你说的，我不虚弱，而且也不是小女孩了。我是个成年的精灵，完全能够照顾自己。"

# chapter4.rpyc:261
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_27f4f364:

    # Merel "I thought you might say that, hehe. You’re so proud, Niene. That’ll be why all the kids used to call you a princess back in Mors Paravail..."
    Merel "就知道你会这么说，嘿嘿。妮妮，你真骄傲。难怪故乡那些孩子都叫你公主……"

# chapter4.rpyc:265
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4bdb89f8:

    # Merel "But, if you’re a princess, then I don’t mind being your humble retainer! I’ll do my best to look after you, and to look out for you, for as long as you need me..."
    Merel "不过，既然你是公主，我就乐意做个卑微的侍从！只要你需要，我都会尽力照顾你，保护你……"

# chapter4.rpyc:267
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_aa22ffcd:

    # Merel "And I’d love it if you could come visit me in Mors Paravail some day. Nothin’ would make me happier, wahaha!"
    Merel "哪天能来莫尔斯·帕拉维尔看我，就更好了！没有比这更让我开心的，哇哈哈！"

# chapter4.rpyc:269
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7d828f71:

    # Nienke "Nothing?"
    Nienke "真的没有？"

# chapter4.rpyc:271
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3ea209cd:

    # Merel "Not that I can think of right now!"
    Merel "至少现在想不出来！"

# chapter4.rpyc:280
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3d3ed4ad:

    # "Merel leans in, caressing my cheek with her palm."
    "她靠近过来，掌心轻抚我的脸颊。"

# chapter4.rpyc:282
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_15177b36:

    # "She dips her head, the tip of her nose brushing my own; her breath pleasantly warm and tingly against my skin."
    "低下头，鼻尖轻轻擦着我的鼻尖。呼吸温暖地拂过皮肤，惹起舒服的微痒。"

# chapter4.rpyc:287
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2e294dca:

    # "Then, she says..."
    "接着，她说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:288
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_606760c0:

    # Merel "I’ve been thinking about you for over fifteen years. You were precious to me back when we were kids, and I was always comin’ to your defence, and you’re still precious to me now."
    Merel "我惦记你，已经超过十五年了。小时候你对我那么重要，我总是站出来护着你。现在也一样重要。"

# chapter4.rpyc:290
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_381a4940:

    # Merel "You mean a lot to me..."
    Merel "你在我心里，占着很大很大的地方……"

# chapter4.rpyc:292
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5bd847a1:

    # Merel "And, now I’ve found you again, I don’t wanna give up on you."
    Merel "好不容易再次找到，我不想放弃你。"

# chapter4.rpyc:293
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_50727cd3:

    # "Merel leans in closer still, until the tips of our noses really are brushing."
    "她又靠近一点，鼻尖终于贴着鼻尖。"

# chapter4.rpyc:294
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_37b3d1ac:

    # "There’s no longer so much as a scant centimetre of space between us as she says, her voice light..."
    "我们之间，连一厘米的空隙都没有了。她轻轻说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:295
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_39aaa85f:

    # Merel "I really do love you."
    Merel "我真的爱你。"

# chapter4.rpyc:297
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7cf60316:

    # Nienke "Mereltje..."
    Nienke "小梅蕾尔……"

# chapter4.rpyc:298
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fb48feb9:

    # "I murmur Merel’s name, or an affectionate diminutive of it, but I don’t get a chance to say much of anything else, not that there’s anything else I really want to say."
    "我低声唤她的名字，或者说，那个亲昵的小称呼。没机会再说别的，不过，也没什么非说不可。"

# chapter4.rpyc:300
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_13dde7e8:

    # "There are emotions I want to communicate to Merel, but I don’t need words to do so."
    "有些感情想传给她，却不一定需要语言。"

# chapter4.rpyc:301
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ca793593:

    # "I let Merel’s eyes skim me, as though she means to consume me."
    "我任她的目光从身上掠过，像要把我整个吞下。"

# chapter4.rpyc:311
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_64ef04c2:

    # "Then, she dips her head."
    "然后，她低下头。"

# chapter4.rpyc:312
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_868b8e42:

    # "I feel her lips against my own, soft and gentle."
    "柔软温柔的唇，贴上我的唇。"

# chapter4.rpyc:313
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bec58e9a:

    # "The kiss isn’t exactly chaste, but I don’t mind that."
    "这个吻并不全然纯情，可我不介意。"

# chapter4.rpyc:314
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e5b08619:

    # "I’m happy giving myself up to Merel."
    "我愿意把自己交给梅蕾尔。"

# chapter4.rpyc:315
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f1a74f28:

    # "I let her kiss me, over and over, beneath the moon..."
    "月光下，任她一次又一次地吻我……"

# chapter4.rpyc:316
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_60731ec9:

    # "And, as she holds me to her, I find myself yearning for her."
    "被她抱着，心里越来越渴望她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:317
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5cfdc7e3:

    # "Now the time is fast approaching for Merel to leave my life, I find that I don’t want her to go."
    "她离开的时刻渐渐逼近，我却发现，自己根本不想让她走。"

# chapter4.rpyc:318
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_341b8a5d:

    # "She promised she would stay with me..."
    "她答应过，要一直陪着我……"

# chapter4.rpyc:319
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_667cf996:

    # "And, just like when we were both young girls, I cling to her."
    "就像我们还都是小女孩的时候，我紧紧依偎着她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:320
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_20a38dd4:

    # "I never want her to leave."
    "永远不想让她离开。"

# chapter4.rpyc:334
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c8079121:

    # Merel "Mmm~ Nothing beats a nice warm bath after a busy day spent outdoors. What do you think? Isn’t this nice?"
    Merel "唔～在外面忙了一整天，没有比泡个热水澡更舒服的了。你说呢？是不是很棒？"

# chapter4.rpyc:335
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_31e45faa:

    # Nienke "Well, it looks like you certainly think that it is..."
    Nienke "嗯，你看着确实觉得很棒……"

# chapter4.rpyc:339
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a40545e8:

    # Nienke "But I don’t know. There’s something kind of e-embarrassing about this..."
    Nienke "可我不知道。总觉得，这样有点难、难为情……"

# chapter4.rpyc:340
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5fd54c53:

    # Merel "Huh?"
    Merel "啊？"

# chapter4.rpyc:341
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_671ccfd7:

    # "Merel pouts."
    "她噘起嘴。"

# chapter4.rpyc:342
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f1fa6431:

    # Merel "Why’re you embarrassed, Niene? I’m not doin’ anything inappropriate, am I?"
    Merel "妮妮，害羞什么？我又没做不合适的事，对吧？"

# chapter4.rpyc:343
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_74ab1c0d:

    # Nienke "W-Well, no, I suppose not..."
    Nienke "是、是没有吧……"

# chapter4.rpyc:344
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7a7911d7:

    # "Though I’m worried part of me (a small part, mind you) wishes that she would."
    "虽然心里有一小部分，注意，是很小的一部分，反而盼着她做点什么。"

# chapter4.rpyc:345
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_714622de:

    # "We’ve since come home, after our foray outdoors, both of us a little windswept; our hair and our clothes rumpled."
    "从外面回来，我们都被风吹得有点乱，头发和衣服皱巴巴的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:346
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_475e5f43:

    # "There were grass stains on the rear of my dress, after spending so much time sitting in that field, and the imprint of the grass could be seen on the backs of Merel’s legs and behind her knees."
    "在田野坐太久，裙子后面沾了草渍，她的大腿后侧和膝窝也压出了草叶的印子。"

# chapter4.rpyc:347
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7de900e4:

    # "I was the one who decided that we both have a bath after getting back home, to wash away any residual dirt and grime, but Merel was the one who suggested that we have a bath together."
    "回家后，我提议都洗个澡，把残留的泥土灰尘洗掉。可一起洗，是她提议的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:348
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_35f9959d:

    # "I was resistant to the idea at first, but Merel was insistent."
    "起初我反对，她却很坚持。"

# chapter4.rpyc:362
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_14ccb230:

    # "She nailed me with a tragic puppy dog look, her lips pressed into a pout, as she said..."
    "她噘着嘴，拿可怜小狗似的眼神望着我，说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:363
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f8442c16:

    # Merel "{i}But Niene! You know I’ll be going back to Mors Paravail tomorrow! This is the last night I’ll be able to spend with you, so I wanna make the most of it!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}可妮妮！明天我就回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔了！这是最后一晚，能跟你一起，我想好好珍惜嘛！{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:364
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2d2c7e76:

    # Merel "{i}We have to spend as much time together as we can, and you always spend such a long time in the bathtub!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}得尽量多待一会儿呀，可你每次泡澡都泡那么久！{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:365
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_26bf3d37:

    # Merel "{i}I don’t wanna be stuck in your room, all on my own, thinking about you for the next hour!{/i}"
    Merel "{i}我不想一个人困在你房里，接下来一小时都只能想着你！{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:366
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7fb39009:

    # Merel "{i}Won’t you let me into the tub with you? I can even help you with your hair! Please, Niene? Please, please, please?{/i}"
    Merel "{i}让我一起泡吧？还可以帮你洗头！妮妮，求求你，好不好，好不好嘛？{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:367
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5a2d4b8b:

    # "Merel kept up a continued string of pleas, her eyes upturned and her hands clasped together in prayer like a Pietà, until I had no choice but to capitulate."
    "她双手合十，抬眼祈求，像一尊哀怜的圣像，不停央求，直到我只好投降。"

# chapter4.rpyc:368
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_07d4a3a0:

    # "I wound up running a deep, warm bath, not just for myself, but for Merel, too."
    "最后放了满满一缸热水，不光给自己，也给她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:369
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_69282302:

    # "I was a little abashed about the whole thing, but..."
    "整件事让我有些羞窘，可是……"

# chapter4.rpyc:380
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_175f12f7:

    # Merel "You don’t need to blush so much, silly. I’m not gonna hurt you, like I said. I’m supposed to be your knight, wahaha~"
    Merel "小傻瓜，别这么脸红嘛。说了不会伤害你，我可是你的骑士，哇哈哈～"

# chapter4.rpyc:381
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fc7596a8:

    # Merel "I wanna look after you, if you’ll let me..."
    Merel "只要你愿意，我就想好好照顾你……"

# chapter4.rpyc:382
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9591d119:

    # Merel "And I really do just wanna help wash your hair. You don’t mind that, do you?"
    Merel "而且真的只是帮你洗头。这个不介意吧？"

# chapter4.rpyc:383
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b9aa59c7:

    # Nienke "Well..."
    Nienke "嗯……"

# chapter4.rpyc:384
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f2348003:

    # "I frown. I’ve only been sitting in the bathtub with Merel for about two minutes, and the water which ripples about me is almost scaldingly hot."
    "我皱起眉。一起坐进浴缸才两分钟左右，身边荡漾的水却热得几乎烫人。"

# chapter4.rpyc:385
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_59393575:

    # "I always run my baths hot, largely because I spend so much time in the tub that the water would soon turn cold if I didn’t."
    "我洗澡水一向放得热，主要是泡太久，不然很快就凉了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:386
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2d026278:

    # "I need the water to be hot so I have enough time to luxuriate — and anyway, I’ve heard very hot water is better for the skin."
    "水够热，才有时间慢慢享受。再说，我还听说，热水对皮肤更好。"

# chapter4.rpyc:387
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_dce1baa7:

    # "I don’t usually regret running my baths so hot, but the combination of the heat of the water coupled with Merel’s presence is a little hard for me to endure."
    "平时不觉得水太热有什么不好，可今天，水温加上梅蕾尔就在身边，实在有点受不住。"

# chapter4.rpyc:388
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d2b550a4:

    # "My heart won’t stop fluttering."
    "心一直跳个不停。"

# chapter4.rpyc:389
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_46f55d76:

    # "I’m afraid my feelings for Merel are so intense that they show too clearly on my face; in my voice."
    "对她的感情太强烈，怕全都清清楚楚写在脸上，漏进声音里。"

# chapter4.rpyc:390
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f67be2c8:

    # "I don’t want her to realise the intensity of my feelings for her..."
    "我不想让她察觉，自己究竟有多喜欢她……"

# chapter4.rpyc:391
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4aa70e7a:

    # Merel "Now, d’you mind if I shampoo your hair a little? I’ll be gentle: I promise!"
    Merel "现在，给你抹点洗发水，好吗？保证轻轻的！"

# chapter4.rpyc:392
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_45fd583a:

    # "But it might be too late for that, after we exchanged those vows in the church."
    "可在教堂里说过那些誓言以后，大概已经晚了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:393
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_58ff613d:

    # "She should already know exactly how I feel about her."
    "她应该早就明白我的心情。"

# chapter4.rpyc:394
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1b66e9f3:

    # "She should know how much I care, so..."
    "早知道我有多在乎，所以……"

# chapter4.rpyc:395
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3f95a664:

    # Nienke "...Oh, alright."
    Nienke "……好吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:396
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2a8eca32:

    # Nienke "I don’t see why you’re so obsessed with my hair when your own is even longer..."
    Nienke "明明自己的头发更长，干吗这么执着于我的……"

# chapter4.rpyc:397
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_48b964d4:

    # Nienke "But, if you absolutely have to play with it, then you can. Knock yourself out..."
    Nienke "不过，非想摆弄不可，就随你吧。尽管折腾，别客气……"

# chapter4.rpyc:398
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_13331979:

    # Nienke "Um, but not literally."
    Nienke "嗯，可别真把自己折腾晕了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:399
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0961fada:

    # Nienke "You’re quite a lot bigger than me, and I’m afraid it’d be a pain hauling you out of the bathtub. I’d have to let you drown instead, and that’d be a pretty sad way to end your visit."
    Nienke "你比我大这么多，从浴缸里拖出来太费劲。我只能放着你淹死，那这次来访就收场得太惨了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:400
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d6fc067a:

    # Merel "Oh, you!"
    Merel "你呀！"

# chapter4.rpyc:401
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_15d3dd15:

    # "Merel rejoins, with a light and easy laugh which fills the bathroom like steam."
    "她轻松地笑出声，笑声像热气一样，充满浴室。"

# chapter4.rpyc:402
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0ef11b34:

    # Merel "You really do have a way with words. You’re so funny!"
    Merel "你这张嘴真厉害，太有意思了！"

# chapter4.rpyc:403
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4517b02a:

    # Nienke "Am I, now?"
    Nienke "是吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:404
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b2cda83c:

    # Merel "Yes, you are. You’re a very peculiar girl, but d’you know what?"
    Merel "是呀，你是个很特别的姑娘。不过，你知道吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:405
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_dd39655f:

    # Nienke "What?"
    Nienke "什么？"

# chapter4.rpyc:406
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_96189ed7:

    # Merel "I’ve heard it said that I’m plenty peculiar too, so maybe we suit one another!"
    Merel "也有人说我挺古怪的，所以我们也许正好相配！"

# chapter4.rpyc:407
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_458bce75:

    # Nienke "Well, we are both elves. We tend to stand out a bit: especially in a small village like Alpenrose."
    Nienke "毕竟都是精灵，多少会显眼一点，尤其在阿尔彭罗瑟这种小村子里。"

# chapter4.rpyc:408
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f63a1efb:

    # Merel "We do indeed. I can’t argue with that, wahaha..."
    Merel "确实，这我没法反驳，哇哈哈……"

# chapter4.rpyc:412
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_cce5ff41:

    # Merel "But I didn’t mean it in that way."
    Merel "不过，我不是那个意思。"

# chapter4.rpyc:413
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0586877c:

    # Nienke "No?"
    Nienke "不是？"

# chapter4.rpyc:414
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ee096f5f:

    # Merel "No. We might both be misfits, on account of being elves, but I don’t think that’s why we get along."
    Merel "不是。因为是精灵，我们可能都有点格格不入，可相处得好，不是因为这个。"

# chapter4.rpyc:415
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8ed3069e:

    # Merel "Roan is an elf too, and I can’t stand him. I think he’s a jerk..."
    Merel "罗安也是精灵，我就受不了他，觉得他是混蛋……"

# chapter4.rpyc:419
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3d513700:

    # Merel "But you’re different."
    Merel "可你不一样。"

# chapter4.rpyc:420
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_14fc9452:

    # Nienke "Well, I’d hope so. I don’t really want to be compared to my childhood bully, and I’m not a boy."
    Nienke "最好是。我可不想跟小时候欺负我的人相提并论，而且我也不是男孩。"

# chapter4.rpyc:421
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_372b46f4:

    # Merel "I know, I know. You’re my Nienke. You’re my princess, and I’m your knight..."
    Merel "知道，知道。你是我的妮恩克，是我的公主，而我是你的骑士……"

# chapter4.rpyc:422
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e6229edb:

    # Merel "And maybe we’re both a little strange, but I think that’s what makes our relationship so special. It’s why I feel so drawn to you..."
    Merel "也许我们都有点奇怪，可正因为这样，这段关系才特别。我才会这么被你吸引……"

# chapter4.rpyc:423
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_78d3f492:

    # Merel "And it’s why I love you so much!"
    Merel "才会这么爱你！"

# chapter4.rpyc:424
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_de111693:

    # Nienke "Y-You love me...?"
    Nienke "你、你爱我……？"

# chapter4.rpyc:425
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_64e6e4b3:

    # Merel "Of course I do. I would’ve thought it was obvious by this point, but if you need me to spell it out..."
    Merel "当然。都到现在了，应该很明显吧。不过，如果非得再说明白一点……"

# chapter4.rpyc:426
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6be4bbe1:

    # "Merel shifts. She parts my hair at my nape, spilling dark strands over my shoulder, and dips her head."
    "她挪了挪，把我颈后的头发分开，深色发丝滑落肩头，然后低下头。"

# chapter4.rpyc:427
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_22228813:

    # "I feel a soft sensation against the nape of my neck — a light brush of lips that doesn’t linger — and then..."
    "后颈传来柔软的触感，嘴唇轻轻擦过，没有停留。接着……"

# chapter4.rpyc:428
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b3db016e:

    # Merel "There. I think that should do the trick, wahaha~"
    Merel "好了，这样应该明白了吧，哇哈哈～"

# chapter4.rpyc:429
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5d585710:

    # Merel "See, Niene? I love you a lot, and I never did stop loving you. I just want to serve you..."
    Merel "妮妮，看见没？我很爱你，也从没停止过。我只是想服侍你……"

# chapter4.rpyc:430
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7a023e78:

    # Merel "And I don’t think there can be any love purer than that, wahaha {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "没有比这更纯粹的爱了吧，哇哈哈{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter4.rpyc:431
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0a086698:

    # "I exhale, my heart still fluttering, as Merel examines me."
    "她看着我，我轻轻呼气，心跳依旧纷乱。"

# chapter4.rpyc:432
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8dc0f7a7:

    # "I hear the sound of a shampoo bottle being uncapped: a clean, crisp click in the stillness of the warm, muggy air. Then, Merel reaches out."
    "湿热安静的空气里，洗发水瓶盖咔嗒一声打开，清晰又干脆。然后，她伸出手。"

# chapter4.rpyc:433
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b2f67de4:

    # "Her fingers, which are slick and wet with shampoo, start to twine through my hair. Her digits brush against my scalp while she works, and I shiver."
    "沾着洗发水、湿滑的手指穿入发间，工作时拂过头皮，惹得我轻轻一颤。"

# chapter4.rpyc:434
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_10114d1d:

    # "There’s something intimate about this gesture: even more so than all of the times she spent brushing my hair."
    "这个动作很亲密，比以前每一次梳头，都更亲密。"

# chapter4.rpyc:435
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_abf856f5:

    # "Is that because we’re both naked?"
    "是因为我们都没穿衣服吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:436
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ccf18a80:

    # "I’m completely exposed to Merel..."
    "我在她面前，完全无所遮蔽……"

# chapter4.rpyc:437
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6cc60429:

    # "And, in the act of exposure, I’m afraid I’m showing her too much of my feelings."
    "怕连同身体，也把太多心意暴露给她了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:438
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a04cd390:

    # "My emotions are intense. They’re out of control. My heart hammers all the harder as Merel runs her fingers through my hair, but I don’t pull away."
    "感情强烈得失去控制。她的手指越在发间穿梭，心就跳得越重，可我没有躲开。"

# chapter4.rpyc:439
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f1befbb3:

    # "At this point, I don’t think I could even if I wanted to."
    "到了这一步，就算想躲，大概也做不到了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:453
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1819643f:

    # "Merel and I eventually finish in the bathtub, after what seems like a small eternity, and we retreat to my bedroom."
    "像过了小小的一辈子，我们总算洗完澡，回到卧室。"

# chapter4.rpyc:454
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9427c3ce:

    # "We lie down beneath the sheets, both of us attired in our pyjamas, and I actually find myself snuggling against Merel, rather than pulling away from her."
    "都穿着睡衣，躺进被窝。我居然主动偎近她，没有再躲开。"

# chapter4.rpyc:455
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1997eca9:

    # "I can’t see any point in trying to put any distance between us: not after everything that’s happened."
    "发生了这么多，已经看不出还有什么必要，刻意留着距离。"

# chapter4.rpyc:456
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_cff0b163:

    # "It feels like a shame it took this long for me to remember my feelings for Merel: that I let so many days pass by being cold, aloof, and unfriendly..."
    "这么久才想起自己的心意，有点可惜。白白浪费那么多天，冷淡、疏远，还不友善……"

# chapter4.rpyc:457
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6126cc08:

    # "But this isn’t the end of our relationship."
    "可这段关系不会就此结束。"

# chapter4.rpyc:458
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_90322278:

    # "I’m sure I’ll be able to see her again one day. We told one another as much."
    "总有一天，还会再见。我们已经答应过彼此。"

# chapter4.rpyc:459
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d92cd73f:

    # "She’ll come and visit me again in Alpenrose, and I can always go to Mors Paravail."
    "她可以再来阿尔彭罗瑟，我也能去莫尔斯·帕拉维尔。"

# chapter4.rpyc:460
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4fb9767c:

    # "There’ll only be about eighty miles, if that, separating us. That’s nothing: not compared to the deep depths of my feelings for her."
    "我们之间不过隔着八十英里，甚至还不到。跟心里深深的感情相比，这点距离不算什么。"

# chapter4.rpyc:461
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fd66e61f:

    # "There’s no need to be melancholy. This isn’t the end. Instead, it’s the beginning of something far greater."
    "不用伤感。这不是结束，而是一段更长远故事的开始。"

# chapter4.rpyc:462
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_69e3698d:

    # "I’m ready to doze off to sleep, the curve of my back pressed against Merel’s chest, when..."
    "后背贴着她的胸口，我正要睡着，就听见……"

# chapter4.rpyc:471
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c089beb7:

    # Merel "Hey, Niene. I just had a thought."
    Merel "喂，妮妮。我刚想到一件事。"

# chapter4.rpyc:472
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e5a6da3c:

    # Nienke "Hmmm...?"
    Nienke "嗯……？"

# chapter4.rpyc:473
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f7c447c9:

    # "I glance behind my shoulder at Merel sleepily, my eyes half-lidded."
    "我半垂着眼，困倦地从肩后看她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:474
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bce3fd9f:

    # "I was just about ready to fall asleep, but her voice pulls me out of my stupor."
    "刚刚都快睡了，声音又把我拉回清醒。"

# chapter4.rpyc:475
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_20222c51:

    # "I’m not sure why, but Merel sounds oddly sombre. Did something happen?"
    "不知道为什么，她听着有点沉重。发生什么了？"

# chapter4.rpyc:476
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c6c31beb:

    # "Maybe she’s thinking about tomorrow, and our inevitable parting."
    "也许在想明天，想那场躲不开的离别。"

# chapter4.rpyc:477
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_607f7dd4:

    # "If I’m being honest, I feel pretty sad about that too, though I’ve been trying not to dwell on it. It hurts more than I ever imagined it would."
    "说实话，我也很难过，只是一直尽量不想。比预想中还要疼。"

# chapter4.rpyc:478
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_63bafc8d:

    # "Is it hurting Merel too?"
    "她也在难过吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:479
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_30a99055:

    # "I do think she’s more sensitive than she lets on."
    "我觉得，她比表现出来的敏感。"

# chapter4.rpyc:480
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9bf7a9b0:

    # Merel "I was just thinkin’..."
    Merel "我就是在想……"

# chapter4.rpyc:481
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c8115b0d:

    # "Merel’s pursed lips tug upwards, into an unmistakable smile."
    "抿着的唇角扬起来，分明是个笑。"

# chapter4.rpyc:482
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0cef2c5d:

    # Merel "Aren’t you glad that I pushed for us to share a bed after all?"
    Merel "幸好我当初坚持一起睡，对吧？现在是不是很庆幸？"

# chapter4.rpyc:483
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6ab6bbb4:

    # Nienke "Huh...?"
    Nienke "啊……？"

# chapter4.rpyc:484
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e1205677:

    # "I blink, nonplussed, my brow furrowing."
    "我茫然地眨眼，蹙起眉。"

# chapter4.rpyc:485
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d531c548:

    # Nienke "Why are you mentioning that now?"
    Nienke "怎么现在提这个？"

# chapter4.rpyc:486
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bcdf0063:

    # Merel "I dunno. I guess I just had a thought, wahaha~"
    Merel "不知道，忽然想到嘛，哇哈哈～"

# chapter4.rpyc:487
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a3adef07:

    # Merel "You were pretty opposed to the idea of us sharin’ a bed in the beginning. You seemed pretty peeved about it, actually..."
    Merel "一开始，你可反对了，还很不高兴呢……"

# chapter4.rpyc:488
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a3ae33fb:

    # Merel "But, thinkin’ about it now, isn’t it a good thing we wound up sharin’ this bed? You’re cuddled up so nicely against me, after all!"
    Merel "可现在想想，一起睡多好呀。你看，你不是正舒舒服服贴着我嘛！"

# chapter4.rpyc:489
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_08a9fbd3:

    # Merel "It’s obvious that you’re enjoyin’ it, hehe. If you’d asked me to sleep on the floor, you’d be denyin’ yourself a real nice pillow..."
    Merel "明显很享受呀，嘿嘿。真让我睡地板，不就少了一个好枕头……"

# chapter4.rpyc:490
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2a655cfe:

    # Merel "Or a couple of pillows, maybe."
    Merel "或者说，两个枕头。"

# chapter4.rpyc:491
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1e0d96d5:

    # Merel "Don’t think I’ve not noticed the way you’ve been resting your head against my chest! You’re so transparent..."
    Merel "别以为没注意，你一直把头靠在我胸前！太好懂啦……"

# chapter4.rpyc:492
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5400530b:

    # Merel "But I think that’s pretty cute, wahahaha!"
    Merel "不过，我觉得特别可爱，哇哈哈哈！"

# chapter4.rpyc:493
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e6430f37:

    # Nienke "O-Oh...!"
    Nienke "啊……！"

# chapter4.rpyc:494
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e8facb2c:

    # "I start, my face flooding scarlet, as Merel makes this observation."
    "被她这么点破，我一惊，整张脸瞬间烧红。"

# chapter4.rpyc:495
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ede7e4db:

    # "I guess I was resting my head against her chest, b-but can you really blame me? Her chest is large and soft, and it is very relaxing!"
    "是靠着她胸口了，可、可这能怪我吗？又大又软，真的很舒服！"

# chapter4.rpyc:496
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4960b162:

    # "I-I don’t think there’s anything wrong with that. I’m not doing anything perverse! I just wanted to doze off to sleep."
    "我、我不觉得哪里不对，又没做什么下流事！只是想睡觉而已。"

# chapter4.rpyc:497
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a0ddc220:

    # "I don’t have any ulterior motives here, so..."
    "没有别的企图，所以……"

# chapter4.rpyc:498
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b5ce283d:

    # Nienke "M-Merel..."
    Nienke "梅、梅蕾尔……"

# chapter4.rpyc:499
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fdc023c6:

    # Merel "Yes, my dear Niene? What is it? {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Merel "嗯，亲爱的妮妮？怎么啦？{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter4.rpyc:500
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_87a81ffb:

    # Nienke "I-I just thought you should know that, though I love you and all..."
    Nienke "我、我只是想告诉你，虽然是爱你没错……"

# chapter4.rpyc:501
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fc8cd9a3:

    # Merel "Yes? What is it?"
    Merel "嗯？什么？"

# chapter4.rpyc:502
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8460f2be:

    # Nienke "You... You..."
    Nienke "你……你……"

# chapter4.rpyc:503
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_03d4f44b:

    # Merel "I?"
    Merel "我？"

# chapter4.rpyc:514
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_79d9fc3d:

    # Nienke "You can be such a jerk sometimes!!!"
    Nienke "你有时候真的很讨厌！！！"

# chapter4.rpyc:529
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a4516f84:

    # "The following day is clear and sunny: the sky overhead a bright and cloudless azure, just like the bottom of the ocean."
    "第二天天气晴朗，头顶一片明亮无云的蔚蓝，像海洋深处。"

# chapter4.rpyc:533
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_80ba9f82:

    # "I arise early, for once: earlier than Merel, who remains curled up in bed on her side, her fair hair scattered all across her pillow."
    "难得有一天，我醒得比梅蕾尔还早。她仍侧身蜷在床上，浅色的头发散了满枕。"

# chapter4.rpyc:534
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_851d8446:

    # "Merel’s eyelids are closed, her lashes matted. Her chest rises and falls in slumber, while warm sunlight from the window spills across her face and cheeks."
    "她闭着眼，睫毛交叠，胸口随着呼吸轻轻起伏。窗外温暖的阳光洒在她的脸颊上。"

# chapter4.rpyc:535
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_691d44e6:

    # "I observe Merel for a few moments, watching as the sun catches in her tresses. In the light, her fair hair almost seems to glow, just like a halo."
    "我看了她一会儿，看阳光落进她的发间。那浅色的发丝几乎在发光，像一圈光环。"

# chapter4.rpyc:536
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6dc78a11:

    # "There’s something almost divine about her. She really does look beautiful..."
    "她看起来近乎圣洁。真漂亮啊……"

# chapter4.rpyc:537
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1c6084d9:

    # "But I know, with a sinking feeling, I won’t get too much of an opportunity to observe Merel today."
    "可一想到今天没多少机会这样看着她，我的心便沉了下去。"

# chapter4.rpyc:538
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e247bd8a:

    # "This is her final day in Alpenrose. She’ll be taking the train back to Mors Paravail after breakfast, where she’ll disappear from my life — but not, I hope, for good."
    "这是她在阿尔彭罗瑟的最后一天。吃过早饭，她就要坐火车回莫尔斯·帕拉维尔，从我的生活里消失——希望，这次只是暂时的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:539
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_55140070:

    # "We made a vow, after all, beneath the stars. She said that she wouldn’t forget me, and that we could see one another again..."
    "毕竟，我们曾在星空下约定过。她说过，她不会忘记我，我们还会再见……"

# chapter4.rpyc:540
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8b0e0770:

    # "And I try to hold this thought in my heart like a pearl: something soft and rare which shimmers."
    "我努力把这个念头珍藏在心里，像藏起一颗泛着柔光的珍贵明珠。"

# chapter4.rpyc:541
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1e8a9ba9:

    # "Merel eventually awakes with a soft sigh; a stretch of her long, muscular limbs."
    "梅蕾尔终于轻叹着醒来，舒展了一下修长结实的四肢。"

# chapter4.rpyc:542
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4c717089:

    # "She greets me with a wry, half-asleep smile — “Why, hello, princess. It’s rare to see you up at this hour!” — then arises."
    "她睡眼惺忪，带着几分促狭笑着跟我打招呼：“哟，公主殿下。这个点就起来了，可真难得！”说完便起了床。"

# chapter4.rpyc:543
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_27e20801:

    # "She changes out of her pyjamas before my roving eyes, seemingly unembarrassed that I’m there. She doesn’t care at all that I’m watching, but why should she, at this point?"
    "她在我的注视下换掉睡衣，似乎一点也不害羞。她完全不介意我看着——都到这一步了，又有什么好介意的呢？"

# chapter4.rpyc:544
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d7bc2e3b:

    # "We {i}did{/i} bathe together last night..."
    "毕竟，昨晚我们{i}还一起洗了澡{/i}……"

# chapter4.rpyc:545
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b47c7040:

    # "Though, now it’s the early morning, I can’t help but feel a bit flustered at seeing Merel undressed, her bare skin exposed."
    "不过，到了这大清早，看见她脱下衣服、露出肌肤，我还是有些慌乱。"

# chapter4.rpyc:546
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a4270138:

    # "I swallow, abashed, and look away."
    "我窘迫地咽了咽口水，移开视线。"

# chapter4.rpyc:547
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_732f2886:

    # "I can’t stare at her too much. I don’t want to seem like a creep."
    "不能一直盯着人家看。我可不想显得像个变态。"

# chapter4.rpyc:548
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2b8839a1:

    # "I don’t want my feelings for Merel to be too obvious — though by this point, I think they should be apparent."
    "我也不想把自己对她的心思表现得太明显——不过，都到这一步了，应该早就藏不住了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:549
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2c123557:

    # "I’m besotted."
    "我已经彻底迷上她了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:550
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_884e0a82:

    # "Merel finishes dressing, then packs her clothes away in her case, not that she bought all that many of them."
    "梅蕾尔换好衣服，把其他衣物收进行李箱。其实，她本来也没带多少。"

# chapter4.rpyc:551
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1a305d41:

    # "Then, the two of us traipse into the kitchen to have breakfast."
    "然后，我们一起走进厨房吃早饭。"

# chapter4.rpyc:552
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b7189324:

    # "My mother has prepared apple pancakes, just as she did during Merel’s first day here. She asks Merel whether she enjoyed herself, and she replies in the positive, while my father asks her to take care of herself."
    "妈妈做了苹果薄饼，跟梅蕾尔来这里第一天时一样。她问梅蕾尔这几天玩得开不开心，梅蕾尔说很开心。爸爸则叮嘱她照顾好自己。"

# chapter4.rpyc:561
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_61631107:

    # Emiel "I’m sure you’ll be fine, a big, tall girl like you, but don’t get into any mischief on the journey back."
    Emiel "你这么高高大大的姑娘，我想不会有事，不过回去路上可别惹什么麻烦。"

# chapter4.rpyc:562
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_11c2572b:

    # Emiel "Bastian’ll have my head if anything happens to you! He’s always been so protective!"
    Emiel "你要是出了事，巴斯蒂安非找我算账不可！他向来把你护得紧！"

# chapter4.rpyc:564
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d6bc980c:

    # "Merel snorts, then rolls her eyes."
    "梅蕾尔嗤笑一声，翻了个白眼。"

# chapter4.rpyc:566
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e26d7bbc:

    # Merel "I think the word you’re looking for’s ‘possessive’. My old man gets so worked up..."
    Merel "我看您想说的是“管得紧”吧。我家老爸总爱大惊小怪……"

# chapter4.rpyc:568
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_84814a8e:

    # Merel "But you don’t need to worry, Emiel! I’ll take real good care of myself! Ain’t nobody gonna get the better of me, wahaha~!"
    Merel "不过放心吧，埃米尔！我会照顾好自己的，没人欺负得了我。哇哈哈～！"

# chapter4.rpyc:570
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1af67830:

    # Emiel "Well, I imagined as much! You always used to be a little warrior, protecting our Nienke. You were just like her guardian, or... No..."
    Emiel "哈哈，我想也是！你小时候就跟个小战士似的，总护着我们妮恩克。简直就是她的守护者，还是……不对……"

# chapter4.rpyc:571
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2fdc6e6f:

    # Emiel "That’s not what you called yourself. What did you say you were again?"
    Emiel "你当时不是这么称呼自己的。你说你是什么来着？"

# chapter4.rpyc:573
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c66ea138:

    # Elowen "Weren’t you Nienke’s knight?"
    Elowen "妮恩克的骑士，对不对？"

# chapter4.rpyc:574
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9d3cebc7:

    # Emiel "Ah, yes! Her knight! I remember that now!"
    Emiel "啊，对！骑士！我想起来了！"

# chapter4.rpyc:575
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_602a091e:

    # Emiel "You always stood up for her against that awful Roan boy. All you were missing was the shining armour and the sword, haha!"
    Emiel "那个讨厌的罗安一欺负她，你就替她出头。就差一副亮闪闪的盔甲和一把剑了，哈哈！"

# chapter4.rpyc:577
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1c16aaf5:

    # Elowen "It’s probably a good thing Merel didn’t have a sword. She was always quite the... ahem, assertive child. I worry she might have seriously hurt Roan."
    Elowen "幸好梅蕾尔当时没有剑。她小时候就挺……咳，有主见的。我真怕她把罗安打伤了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:578
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b6428a75:

    # Emiel "And I think Roan seriously deserved it! The boy — and I don’t like being rude about children, but this is a fact — was an ass."
    Emiel "我倒觉得他活该！我不喜欢说小孩子的坏话，可实话就是——那小子是个混蛋。"

# chapter4.rpyc:579
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fac7cf72:

    # Elowen "Oh, dear!"
    Elowen "哎呀，你真是的！"

# chapter4.rpyc:580
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_41327f72:

    # "My mother tuts, but she doesn’t look too upset. She gives my father a nudge, then says, her voice lightly admonishing..."
    "妈妈嗔了一声，却也没多生气。她轻轻推了爸爸一下，带着几分责备说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:581
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a0104cc0:

    # Elowen "Roan was only a young boy, and this {i}did{/i} happen almost fifteen years ago. You need to learn to let bygones be bygones."
    Elowen "罗安那时也只是个孩子，而且这{i}都{/i}快十五年了。你也该学着让过去的事过去了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:582
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5841f047:

    # Emiel "Not when my daughter is involved, I don’t. I heard some of the things he said about Nienke."
    Emiel "牵扯到我女儿，我可放不下。他拿什么话说妮恩克，我又不是没听过。"

# chapter4.rpyc:583
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_79b96d88:

    # Emiel "He was such a louse!"
    Emiel "真是个讨厌鬼！"

# chapter4.rpyc:585
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_65902907:

    # Merel "Hear, hear! He was horrible, but I gave him what for. As Nienke’s knight, it is my job to protect her."
    Merel "就是说啊！他可讨厌了，不过我也没让他好过。我可是妮恩克的骑士，保护她就是我的职责。"

# chapter4.rpyc:587
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fc065547:

    # Merel "I’m not gonna let anybody lay a hand on her. That’s my job!"
    Merel "谁也别想碰她一根手指。有我在呢！"

# chapter4.rpyc:588
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b0a08682:

    # Elowen "And you’ve always done a wonderful job at it, dear. You’re the best friend my daughter could imagine..."
    Elowen "你一直都做得很好，亲爱的。妮恩克再也找不到比你更好的朋友了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:589
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e0ba5d98:

    # Elowen "Though I suppose you’ve always been more to Nienke than just a friend."
    Elowen "不过，对她来说，你大概一直都不只是朋友。"

# chapter4.rpyc:590
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_904aec49:

    # "I wonder, for a few moments, if my mother has realised mine and Merel’s relationship has progressed past ‘mere’ friendship (she’s always been sharp), when..."
    "有那么一瞬间，我怀疑妈妈已经看出我和梅蕾尔的关系不再“只是”友情了。她一向很敏锐。而这时……"

# chapter4.rpyc:592
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1704aec5:

    # Elowen "You’re her knight, and it seems like that hasn’t changed."
    Elowen "你是她的骑士，这一点似乎始终没变。"

# chapter4.rpyc:593
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_425154ef:

    # Elowen "I can still rely on you to look out for her, even now. You’ve always been so good to her."
    Elowen "直到现在，我也能放心把她交给你照顾。你一直都对她那么好。"

# chapter4.rpyc:601
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b3c84486:

    # "...Phew. It seems like my mother doesn’t know after all."
    "……呼。看来妈妈还是不知道。"

# chapter4.rpyc:603
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2d11c994:

    # "It’s not like I’m worried about her reaction (I’m sure my parents will be perfectly supportive), but I don’t necessarily want to colour Merel’s last day here with a discussion about our burgeoning relationship."
    "我倒不是担心她的反应——爸妈肯定会支持我们的。只是，我不太想在梅蕾尔待在这里的最后一天，讨论我们才刚开始的恋情。"

# chapter4.rpyc:604
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8bf04dd9:

    # "We can save that for later."
    "这件事，留到以后再说吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:606
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_1078f3f6:

    # "I’m less worried that my parents won’t accept us, and I’m more worried they’ll be a little {i}too{/i} accepting."
    "比起爸妈不接受，我更担心他们接受得{i}太过热情{/i}。"

# chapter4.rpyc:607
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_01bdb520:

    # "Knowing my father, he’ll want to reassure me at least twenty times that he doesn’t think there’s anything wrong with me wanting to date a girl, and I just don’t want to endure that at the moment."
    "以我爸的性格，他至少得向我保证二十遍，他完全不介意我想跟女孩子交往。我现在实在不想承受这个。"

# chapter4.rpyc:617
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_40218d7b:

    # "We resume our eating, our forks scraping against our plates in harmony, when a sudden mewl makes Merel start."
    "我们继续吃早饭，叉子碰着盘子，叮叮当当。一声突如其来的猫叫让梅蕾尔一愣。"

# chapter4.rpyc:620
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_75183941:

    # "She blinks, then glances down at the floor, between her legs, to see..."
    "她眨眨眼，低头朝双腿之间的地板看去……"

# chapter4.rpyc:621
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e326b013:

    # Elowen "Oh, Engelmund. I was wondering where you’d gotten to."
    Elowen "哎呀，恩格尔蒙德。我还在想你跑哪儿去了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:623
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_95efc56d:

    # Elowen "I thought you might have gone to the van der Lindens to go begging for scraps again, but maybe not."
    Elowen "我以为你又去范德林登家讨吃的了，看来没有呀。"

# chapter4.rpyc:624
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5479142c:

    # Elowen "Are you here to see Merel off, dear?"
    Elowen "你是来送梅蕾尔的吗，小家伙？"

# chapter4.rpyc:626
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_cbcc72ff:

    # Nienke "Chance would be a fine thing."
    Nienke "他要真有这份心就好了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:627
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5129b897:

    # "I mumble, with a roll of my eyes."
    "我翻着白眼，小声嘀咕。"

# chapter4.rpyc:629
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4628c340:

    # Nienke "I know that cat, and he’s the most opportunistic fluffball I’ve ever seen. He’ll just be here for Merel’s pancakes."
    Nienke "这只猫我还不知道？再没有比他更会钻空子的毛球了。他肯定是冲着梅蕾尔的薄饼来的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:631
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_71e642d1:

    # "Engelmund, the opportunistic fluffball in question, mewls disparagingly, then rubs his white head against Merel’s calf."
    "被点名的投机毛球不满地喵了一声，又拿白脑袋蹭了蹭梅蕾尔的小腿。"

# chapter4.rpyc:632
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d43e8e98:

    # "I’m wise to Engelmund’s tricks, and he isn’t fooling me: not for a second. I doubt he gives a fig that Merel will be leaving. He’s come here for one thing, and one thing alone..."
    "恩格尔蒙德那点把戏，我清楚得很，半点也骗不了我。他才不在乎梅蕾尔要走呢。他来这里就只有一个目的……"

# chapter4.rpyc:634
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_80907d86:

    # Merel "Oh, don’t be so mean to him, Nienke! He’s just a cute kitty. Isn’t that right, boy?"
    Merel "哎呀，妮恩克，别把他说得那么坏嘛！人家只是只可爱的小猫。对不对呀？"

# chapter4.rpyc:636
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8b50d1bd:

    # Engelmund "Mrr!"
    Engelmund "喵呜！"

# chapter4.rpyc:638
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_de1bddd9:

    # "But Merel is completely taken in."
    "可梅蕾尔完全上当了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:640
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_50ad2c18:

    # "I sigh, then say..."
    "我叹了口气，说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:642
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0e80b715:

    # Nienke "You shouldn’t encourage him. He’s had his breakfast already."
    Nienke "别惯着他了。他已经吃过早饭了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:644
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f45109bb:

    # Merel "Maybe so, but your mother’s pancakes are really yummy. It’d be criminal to deprive him of them!"
    Merel "那也没办法呀，你妈妈做的薄饼这么好吃。不让他吃，简直是罪过！"

# chapter4.rpyc:646
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0effa1d9:

    # Nienke "He’s hardly deprived. Haven’t you seen how big he is?"
    Nienke "他可没缺过吃的。你没看见他都多大一团了吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:650
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d4272757:

    # Emiel "Nienke has a good point. He’s starting to look alarmingly roly-poly..."
    Emiel "妮恩克说得有道理。他现在圆得都有点吓人了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:651
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d8356740:

    # Emiel "But I can’t blame him for loving Elowen’s pancakes! I’d eat them for breakfast, lunch, and dinner if I could!"
    Emiel "不过，喜欢艾洛温做的薄饼，也不能怪他！换成我，能一天三顿都吃这个！"

# chapter4.rpyc:652
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a382112d:

    # Elowen "Oh, you! You’re such a charmer!"
    Elowen "你呀，就会说好听的！"

# chapter4.rpyc:653
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_47b0c339:

    # Emiel "No, I’m not. You know I couldn’t charm my way out of a paper bag. I’ve always been horribly awkward..."
    Emiel "我哪有。我嘴有多笨，你还不知道？我向来都不会哄人……"

# chapter4.rpyc:654
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5c7153e1:

    # Emiel "But it wasn’t that hard to win you over. All I had to do was be honest about your many, many charms."
    Emiel "不过，要打动你倒也没那么难。只要把你那么多的好处，老老实实说出来就行了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:655
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_df0d5968:

    # Emiel "I think you did all of the hard work for me when I was trying to court you, dear!"
    Emiel "当初追求你时，最难的部分都是你替我做完的，亲爱的！"

# chapter4.rpyc:656
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6417e364:

    # Elowen "Oh, Emiel {font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"
    Elowen "哎呀，埃米尔{font=gui/fonts/default.ttf}♡{/font}"

# chapter4.rpyc:658
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_37b18c6d:

    # "My mother sighs, her cheek cupped with her palm. She’s practically swooning. Euch."
    "妈妈用手托着脸颊，轻轻叹了一声，简直要陶醉了。呃。"

# chapter4.rpyc:659
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7e9974c9:

    # "I’m glad my parents get on so well, of course (I would far rather they love one another too much than not enough), but who wants to watch their parents flirt this early in the morning?"
    "爸妈感情这么好，我当然很高兴。爱得太多，总比不够爱要好。可是，谁想大清早看爸妈打情骂俏啊？"

# chapter4.rpyc:661
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_52f8f767:

    # "I turn my attention to Merel, but..."
    "我把注意力转向梅蕾尔，可是……"

# chapter4.rpyc:663
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_caeaf545:

    # Merel "Who’s a good boy? You are! You’re such a cutie!"
    Merel "谁是乖孩子呀？是你呀！怎么这么可爱！"

# chapter4.rpyc:665
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9ddabf80:

    # Engelmund "Mreow!"
    Engelmund "喵呜！"

# chapter4.rpyc:666
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8d171514:

    # "She’s busy cossetting Engelmund."
    "她正忙着宠恩格尔蒙德呢。"

# chapter4.rpyc:670
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c5645c0e:

    # "Geez. I’m starting to feel pretty prickly here: so much so, my expression probably looks a lot like Mrs van Dijk’s."
    "真是的，我开始有点不高兴了。现在这副表情，恐怕跟范戴克太太也差不多。"

# chapter4.rpyc:671
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4009452f:

    # "I can’t believe Merel cares more about my greedy cat than she cares about the fact we won’t be seeing one another for ages."
    "我们马上就要好久见不着面了，梅蕾尔居然更关心我家那只贪吃猫。"

# chapter4.rpyc:672
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_14af10a0:

    # "How cold."
    "真冷淡。"

# chapter4.rpyc:674
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_70e95ae9:

    # Nienke "You know, you don’t need to baby Engelmund. He’s not a little kid."
    Nienke "你不用把恩格尔蒙德当宝宝哄。他又不是小孩子。"

# chapter4.rpyc:675
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_74446898:

    # "I mumble mutinously, as Merel feeds my thieving fluffball of a cat some of her pancakes."
    "梅蕾尔把薄饼掰给那只偷吃的毛球时，我不服气地嘟囔。"

# chapter4.rpyc:676
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_28b64ee5:

    # Nienke "He’s almost eighteen."
    Nienke "他都快十八岁了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:678
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_6b5c688f:

    # Merel "Oh! Is he an old man, then?"
    Merel "哦！那他是个老爷爷啦？"

# chapter4.rpyc:679
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bd72ea8e:

    # Elowen "Hmm... In cat years, I think he’s equivalent to an eighty-year-old."
    Elowen "嗯……按猫的年纪算，差不多相当于人八十岁吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:680
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_17d6af30:

    # Emiel "You mean, he’s about as old as Mrs van Dijk?!"
    Emiel "你是说，他跟范戴克太太差不多大？！"

# chapter4.rpyc:681
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3aeeeee7:

    # Elowen "I think so."
    Elowen "应该是吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:683
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ec4e9331:

    # Merel "Whew. No way. He’s nowhere near as cranky as she is!"
    Merel "哇，不会吧。他脾气可比她好多了！"

# chapter4.rpyc:684
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b8752b7b:

    # "Merel titters, while my father smiles."
    "梅蕾尔咯咯笑起来，爸爸也笑了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:686
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_585913d8:

    # Emiel "That woman can be hard work, yes, but I think she has arthritis. That cane isn’t just a fashion statement."
    Emiel "她有时候是不好应付，不过我想她有关节炎。那根拐杖可不只是拿着好看的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:687
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_06480a0f:

    # Emiel "I can’t take too much umbrage with her..."
    Emiel "我也不好跟她计较太多……"

# chapter4.rpyc:688
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_48d7cdcb:

    # Emiel "And she {i}is{/i} one of our most loyal customers."
    Emiel "而且，她{i}确实{/i}是我们最忠实的老顾客之一。"

# chapter4.rpyc:690
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9b208fbc:

    # Merel "Oh, I didn’t mean anythin’ bad by it. I like her too, for all her funny, old-fashioned ways..."
    Merel "哎，我也没什么恶意。虽然她有些古板的小脾气，我还是挺喜欢她的……"

# chapter4.rpyc:692
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a7464cfe:

    # Merel "But Englemund doesn’t act like an eighty-year-old! He’s still plenty spry!"
    Merel "不过恩格尔蒙德可不像八十岁！他精神着呢！"

# chapter4.rpyc:694
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_dd39655f_1:

    # Nienke "What?"
    Nienke "什么？"

# chapter4.rpyc:695
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0e20e173:

    # "I scoff. Is Merel talking about the same cat here?"
    "我嗤了一声。梅蕾尔说的，真是同一只猫吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:696
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_89241c43:

    # "I’m glad she likes him, but..."
    "她喜欢他，我是挺高兴的，可是……"

# chapter4.rpyc:698
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fc18e929:

    # Nienke "Haven’t you seen him? He struggles to get up and down the stairs nowadays. He doesn’t exactly pad: he {i}lumbers.{/i}"
    Nienke "你没看见吗？他现在上下楼都费劲。走路哪还叫轻巧，分明是{i}挪着走{/i}。"

# chapter4.rpyc:700
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_304eb41b:

    # Merel "And yet, he still manages to pad into your bedroom every morning to wake you up, sleepyhead! I think that’s very impressive."
    Merel "可他每天早上还是能走进你房间，把你这小懒虫叫醒啊！这已经很厉害了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:701
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0e55346c:

    # Merel "It’s worth a few bits of apple pancake, at least!"
    Merel "起码值得奖励几口苹果薄饼！"

# chapter4.rpyc:705
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_68db4891:

    # Nienke "Hmph."
    Nienke "哼。"

# chapter4.rpyc:706
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_509996dd:

    # "I harrumph, arms folded, as I mumble..."
    "我抱着胳膊哼了一声，小声嘀咕……"

# chapter4.rpyc:708
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_21590dff:

    # Nienke "Well, don’t give all your breakfast away. You’ll be hungry on the train later."
    Nienke "那你也别把早饭全给他。待会儿坐火车会饿的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:710
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d4d142ea:

    # Merel "Oh~?"
    Merel "哦～？"

# chapter4.rpyc:711
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0c36d6b9:

    # "Merel’s red eyes light up. She grins, nudging me under the table with her foot and, taking care to use my childhood nickanme, she says..."
    "梅蕾尔红色的眼睛亮了起来。她咧嘴笑着，在桌底下用脚碰了碰我，还特意叫起了我小时候的昵称……"

# chapter4.rpyc:712
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7b63970c:

    # Merel "Are you worrying about me, Niene?"
    Merel "担心我啦，妮妮？"

# chapter4.rpyc:714
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_95d97409:

    # Nienke "N-No, I am—"
    Nienke "才、才没有，我——"

# chapter4.rpyc:716
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_496e0010:

    # Elowen "Oh, I rather think she is. I get the feeling that our Nienke is very fond of you, dear."
    Elowen "哎呀，我看是呢。我觉得我们妮恩克可喜欢你了，亲爱的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:717
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e3c464b5:

    # Emiel "Me too. I’m glad you two get along so well!"
    Emiel "我也这么觉得。你们俩感情这么好，真让人高兴！"

# chapter4.rpyc:719
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a7faab96:

    # Nienke "Hey."
    Nienke "喂。"

# chapter4.rpyc:720
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_49397327:

    # "I pout, looking between my parents, as I say..."
    "我鼓着脸颊，来回看着爸妈，说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:721
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f7706b59:

    # Nienke "You don’t need to talk about me like that. I’m sitting right here."
    Nienke "我还坐在这儿呢。你们别当着我的面这么说啊。"

# chapter4.rpyc:722
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4b88501b:

    # Elowen "Oh, we’re only passing comment because we care. Don’t worry about it, dear."
    Elowen "哎呀，还不是因为关心你，才多说两句。别在意，亲爱的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:724
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_9ddabf80_1:

    # Engelmund "Mreow!"
    Engelmund "喵呜！"

# chapter4.rpyc:726
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fe1d38ec:

    # "Engelmund meows, as if in agreement, while I sigh."
    "恩格尔蒙德喵了一声，像是在附和。我叹了口气。"

# chapter4.rpyc:727
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3ac9cebc:

    # "Breakfasts have certainly become more hectic since Merel moved in..."
    "梅蕾尔住进来以后，早饭时间确实热闹了不少……"

# chapter4.rpyc:729
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8e80b99c:

    # "But this will be the last breakfast I have with her for a while."
    "可是，接下来好一阵子，这就是我最后一次跟她一起吃早饭了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:730
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_317e8c53:

    # "She’s going to leave in less than an hour and, for all my harrumphing, I know I’ll miss her."
    "再过不到一个小时，她就要走了。嘴上再怎么哼哼唧唧，我也知道，我会想她的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:732
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_97411718:

    # "It’s sad that our week together has come to a close so quickly, but we should have plenty more time together in the future."
    "这一周这么快就结束了，真让人难过。不过，以后我们还会有很多相处的时间。"

# chapter4.rpyc:740
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d8c9ae1d:

    # "I tell myself this as I rise from the table, and as I volunteer to walk Merel to the train station."
    "我这样告诉自己，随后离开餐桌，主动提出送梅蕾尔去车站。"

# chapter4.rpyc:741
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8a7a975f:

    # "Together, the two of us slide our shoes on by the front door, Engelmund at our heels."
    "我们一起在前门穿鞋，恩格尔蒙德跟在脚边。"

# chapter4.rpyc:742
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bb3a8539:

    # "Is he begging for even more scraps? If so, he’ll be disappointed."
    "还想讨吃的？那他可要失望了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:744
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f7c820a4:

    # "Merel pauses to stroke the top of his head, and to wish him a goodbye. Then, together, we exit from the back of the café, where the deliveries usually arrive."
    "梅蕾尔停下来摸了摸他的头，跟他告别。然后，我们从平时送货的咖啡馆后门走了出去。"

# chapter4.rpyc:752
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_18ca80ee:

    # "Merel and I walk through the cobblestoned streets of Alpenrose, just the two of us. The breeze catches in my hair, so it flutters, while the soles of my feet slap against the ground."
    "阿尔彭罗瑟的石板路上，只有我和梅蕾尔并肩走着。微风拂动我的头发，脚步一下一下落在路面上。"

# chapter4.rpyc:753
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d209feca:

    # "It’s a lovely day and the air smells clean and fresh."
    "天气很好，空气也清新干净。"

# chapter4.rpyc:754
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_67c05eda:

    # "It’s invigorating: so much so, I find myself smiling despite the knowledge that I’ll soon be saying goodbye to Merel."
    "这样的天气让人精神一振。即使明知道很快就要跟梅蕾尔道别，我还是不自觉地笑了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:766
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_65804bb3:

    # "We arrive at the station in good time, then Merel turns to me."
    "我们早早到了车站，梅蕾尔转过身来。"

# chapter4.rpyc:768
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_0fdd5957:

    # "She sets down her peeling leather suitcase with a thud and says..."
    "她把那只皮面剥落的行李箱咚的一声放在地上，说……"

# chapter4.rpyc:772
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_946fc392:

    # Merel "I guess this is it. I’ll be leavin’ soon — but don’t lose heart, Niene! I’m sure we’ll see one another again soon. I mean, I promised you, didn’t I?"
    Merel "看来就到这儿啦。我马上要走了——不过，别难过，妮妮！我们肯定很快就能再见。我不是答应过你了吗？"

# chapter4.rpyc:774
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_90c4b544:

    # Merel "I’m gonna come back to Alpenrose to see you some day, and you can always come to Mors Paravail to see me! S’not like this is the end!"
    Merel "以后我会再来阿尔彭罗瑟看你，你也随时能来莫尔斯·帕拉维尔找我！又不是再也见不到了！"

# chapter4.rpyc:783
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f3c06421:

    # "She says that, and I’m sure she means it, but my heart still twists in my chest."
    "她这样说，我也相信她是真心的，可胸口还是一阵绞痛。"

# chapter4.rpyc:784
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_961ac0e2:

    # "I tried to kid myself during breakfast, but I can’t do it anymore. I need to face up to the facts."
    "吃早饭时，我还能试着骗骗自己，现在却做不到了。我得面对现实。"

# chapter4.rpyc:786
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5203f304:

    # "Merel is going to leave me. That much is an indisputable fact. She’s standing on the same platform that Cornelia did almost two years prior, when she left Alpenrose for Utrecht."
    "梅蕾尔要离开我了。这是无可争辩的事实。她站着的月台，跟将近两年前科妮莉娅离开阿尔彭罗瑟、前往乌得勒支时，是同一个。"

# chapter4.rpyc:787
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_71c8cc7f:

    # "Cornelia promised she would write too — and, for a while, she did."
    "科妮莉娅也说过会写信——有一段时间，她确实写了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:788
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_a097d8fd:

    # "She used to write to me religiously: often multiple times a week..."
    "她曾经很勤快地给我写信，常常一周好几封……"

# chapter4.rpyc:790
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_c4160645:

    # "But the letters eventually, invariably, ran dry."
    "可到最后，信还是渐渐没了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:792
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_32b1b40d:

    # "I stopped being important to her the moment she became accustomed to her new life and made some new friends."
    "她习惯了新生活，交了新朋友，我就变得不那么重要了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:793
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5858a7d2:

    # "She never stopped being my friend, but she stopped caring quite so much."
    "她并没有不把我当朋友，只是不再那么在乎我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:795
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_bf1986c9:

    # "I stopped being important to her."
    "我对她来说，不再重要了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:797
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d1cc80c3:

    # "I’m afraid that this will happen again, and Merel will forget about me just like Cornelia seemingly did..."
    "我害怕同样的事再发生一次，害怕梅蕾尔也会像科妮莉娅那样，把我渐渐忘掉……"

# chapter4.rpyc:799
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3dc7bfcd:

    # "But maybe I’m being unduly paranoid."
    "可是，也许我只是想得太多。"

# chapter4.rpyc:800
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_d0ed939e:

    # "I’ve known Merel for even longer than I have Cornelia — and, though I forgot Merel, she never did forget me."
    "我认识梅蕾尔，比认识科妮莉娅还要早。即使我忘了她，她也从没有忘记我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:802
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_958939d1:

    # "She thought of me for fifteen years, and she was determined to renew our friendship."
    "她惦记了我十五年，一心想跟我重新做回朋友。"

# chapter4.rpyc:803
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ab4b8d65:

    # "I never left her mind, though we were separated by a lapse in my own memories; by almost fifteen years..."
    "即使我的记忆断了，即使我们分开了将近十五年，她心里也始终有我……"

# chapter4.rpyc:805
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_16e87043:

    # "So saying goodbye to her now should be a simple affair."
    "所以，现在的道别，应该没什么难的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:807
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3bf8b5a2:

    # "She’ll be leaving my life, but she won’t be leaving my heart."
    "她会暂时离开我的生活，却不会离开我的心。"

# chapter4.rpyc:808
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f9cff7b4:

    # "If our relationship was able to withstand a fifteen year absence, then it should be able to endure this, too."
    "我们的感情既然经得起十五年的分别，就一定也经得起这一次。"

# chapter4.rpyc:810
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_4604c09a:

    # "I stare at Merel’s wide, red irises, which are richer than wine, more vibrant and vivid than blood, and exhale."
    "我望着她睁大的红色眼眸，轻轻呼出一口气。那双眼睛比红酒更浓郁，比鲜血更明艳。"

# chapter4.rpyc:812
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5976b3c5:

    # "I know I’m being silly. I shouldn’t worry so much."
    "我知道自己在犯傻。我不该这么担心的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:814
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_aa161105:

    # "Part of me can’t help but worry, I suppose, but..."
    "可心里总有一部分，还是忍不住……"

# chapter4.rpyc:824
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_955b54bc:

    # Nienke "Do you promise you won’t forget me...?"
    Nienke "你保证，不会忘了我……？"

# chapter4.rpyc:826
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3669b19e:

    # Merel "I promise."
    Merel "我保证。"

# chapter4.rpyc:827
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_e6a6737d:

    # Merel "I’m bein’ nothing but sincere when I tell you how much I care about you."
    Merel "我说我有多在乎你，每一句都是真心话。"

# chapter4.rpyc:831
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_43bfa1be:

    # Merel "I’m your knight in shining armour, so you can rely on me."
    Merel "我可是你的骑士。你可以依靠我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:833
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_b586ae0f:

    # "Merel squeezes my right hand with her own, while she lifts her free arm and caresses my cheek with her fingers."
    "梅蕾尔握紧我的右手，抬起另一只手，用手指轻抚我的脸颊。"

# chapter4.rpyc:834
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_f81af154:

    # "I shiver from the feeling of it, sensation prickling from my tip to my toe, as Merel leans in."
    "我浑身一颤，那触感仿佛从头顶一路蔓延到脚尖。梅蕾尔俯身靠近。"

# chapter4.rpyc:838
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_ffd5708e:

    # "Her eyelids fall shut, her pale lashes matting together, while mine follow suit."
    "她闭上眼，浅色的睫毛交叠在一起。我也随她闭上了眼睛。"

# chapter4.rpyc:840
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_2e166e9b:

    # "I stand on my tiptoes, pressing my own body against Merel’s own, feeling her heart hammering in tandem with my own."
    "我踮起脚尖，让身体紧贴着她，感受着她的心跳，和我的一起怦怦作响。"

# chapter4.rpyc:850
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_87bea5eb:

    # "Then, I feel a soft sensation against my lips."
    "随后，嘴唇上传来柔软的触感。"

# chapter4.rpyc:851
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_98a24b59:

    # "Merel is kissing me, though it doesn’t come as any great surprise."
    "梅蕾尔吻了我。我并不意外。"

# chapter4.rpyc:852
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_070a4f88:

    # "This is what I was hoping for."
    "这正是我期待的。"

# chapter4.rpyc:856
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_3c110b5c:

    # "I want to bask in her kindness. I want Merel to sweep me away with the depths of her feelings as, once more, we reaffirm how much we care for one another."
    "我想沉浸在她的温柔里，任她深切的情意将我带走。我们又一次确认着，彼此究竟有多重要。"

# chapter4.rpyc:857
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5306030c:

    # "I know that Merel is going to leave soon. That much is inevitable. Her train is going to arrive in five minutes."
    "我知道，她马上就要走了。这无法改变。再过五分钟，火车就会进站。"

# chapter4.rpyc:858
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_72f6b51b:

    # "She’ll board it, and then she’ll be taken into the countryside; away from me."
    "她会坐上火车，驶入乡野，离我远去。"

# chapter4.rpyc:859
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_048aaa7f:

    # "I won’t be able to see her for a while, but that’s alright."
    "我会有一段时间见不到她，不过，没关系。"

# chapter4.rpyc:860
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_fb3d1f17:

    # "The heroines in the romance stories I love so much have to endure much harder... um, hardship, but they endure in the end."
    "我最喜欢的爱情故事里，那些女主角经历过比这艰难得多的……嗯，艰难险阻，可她们最终都坚持下来了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:861
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7327b06e:

    # "Love prevails. It always does."
    "爱情会赢的。一直都是。"

# chapter4.rpyc:862
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_5c538568:

    # "I’ll see Merel again, whether this takes a couple of weeks or months, or even years."
    "不管要等几个星期、几个月，甚至几年，我都会再见到梅蕾尔。"

# chapter4.rpyc:863
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_7debcaac:

    # "I’m not going to forget the time we spent together."
    "我不会忘记我们相处的时光。"

# chapter4.rpyc:864
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_8e3847e4:

    # "This time, I’ll keep Merel close to my heart. I’ll remember her no matter where she goes, and no matter what she does..."
    "这一次，我会把她好好放在心里。不论她去哪里、做什么，我都不会忘记她……"

# chapter4.rpyc:865
translate zh_CN_portable chapter4_df936a99:

    # "And I’m sure, in the end, we’ll be able to secure our own happily ever after."
    "我相信，最后，我们也能迎来属于自己的幸福结局。"

# chapter4.rpyc:905
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_3739ecca:

    # "I don’t think I’ve ever been on a train before — or, if I have, I don’t remember it."
    "我好像从没坐过火车。就算坐过，也不记得了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:906
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_51933c46:

    # "Now that I think about it, I must have been on a train at some point in the past. I’m sure that my parents took the train — {i}this{/i} train — when we moved from Mors Paravail to Alpenrose all of those years ago."
    "仔细想想，以前肯定坐过。多年前从莫尔斯·帕拉维尔搬来阿尔彭罗瑟时，爸妈一定也是坐的火车——就是{i}这趟{/i}火车。"

# chapter4.rpyc:907
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_c9ef5c55:

    # "It’s the quickest and the easiest way to travel. The train is convenient, and it covers miles in only a few minutes."
    "这是最快、最方便的出行方式。短短几分钟，就能走过好几英里。"

# chapter4.rpyc:908
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_51cc4db2:

    # "If you were to walk from Mors Paravail to Alpenrose on foot, it would take three days. On a train, however, it only takes three hours."
    "从莫尔斯·帕拉维尔步行到阿尔彭罗瑟，要走三天。坐火车，却只要三个小时。"

# chapter4.rpyc:909
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_78d6f4d6:

    # "Trains really are convenient."
    "火车真方便啊。"

# chapter4.rpyc:913
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_ab28e688:

    # "I know they’re inanimate objects, so it seems a bit silly to personify them, but they feel a little bit like butlers to me: well-maintained, quiet enough to be unnoticeable, and eager to serve."
    "我知道，火车没有生命，把它当成人似乎有点傻。可我总觉得，它有点像管家：整洁体面，安静得几乎让人忘记它的存在，又随时乐意效劳。"

# chapter4.rpyc:914
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_2dfe4b32:

    # "I was half-expecting to see a man with slicked back hair bowing to me as I stepped onto the train, with a prim and proper, “Good afternoon, milady. How may I be of assistance?”"
    "踏上火车时，我甚至有点期待，会有个头发梳得一丝不乱的男人向我鞠躬，彬彬有礼地说：“下午好，小姐。有什么可以为您效劳？”"

# chapter4.rpyc:915
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_2ae239fd:

    # "That didn’t happen, but a girl can dream."
    "当然，并没有。不过，想想总可以吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:916
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_f6353b8d:

    # "There was a woman who went about with a trolley loaded with various wares: sandwiches, little pots of salad, and sweets."
    "倒是有位女士推着小车来回走动，车上摆着各种东西：三明治、小盒沙拉，还有糖果。"

# chapter4.rpyc:917
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_57aa1e68:

    # "I bought a sandwich, and I picked at it as I watched the sky outside the window."
    "我买了个三明治，一边望着窗外的天空，一边小口吃着。"

# chapter4.rpyc:918
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_d7947b4d:

    # "This can’t be my first time on a train, but it feels like it might as well be."
    "这不可能是我第一次坐火车，可感觉上，跟第一次也没有区别。"

# chapter4.rpyc:919
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_89e5c527:

    # "I don’t remember the frantic journey my parents made from Mors Paravail to Alpenrose all of those years ago, as my mother pressed my feverish brow to her chest, fearing the worst."
    "多年前，爸妈从莫尔斯·帕拉维尔匆匆赶往阿尔彭罗瑟的那段旅途，我一点也不记得了。那时，妈妈把我发烫的额头紧贴在胸前，担心着最坏的结果。"

# chapter4.rpyc:920
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_5080ce0f:

    # "My parents saw me to the station, and they sat with me in the train for a few minutes before it departed. They seemed awed by how clean everything was: how neat and tidy."
    "这次，爸妈送我到了车站，发车前还陪我在车厢里坐了一会儿。这里处处干净整齐，让他们很惊讶。"

# chapter4.rpyc:934
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4c8cacff:

    # Emiel g "{i}The trains weren’t like this fifteen years ago. You’re being spoiled, Nienke.{/i}"
    Emiel g "{i}十五年前的火车可不是这样的。妮恩克，你这次可享福了。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:935
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_26d72e1d:

    # Emiel "{i}When we first came to Alpenrose, the carriage was ancient, and it creaked like an old woman. It was positively arthritic, just like Mrs van Dijk!{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}我们刚来阿尔彭罗瑟时，车厢老得不行，吱吱嘎嘎，跟老太太似的。简直就是得了关节炎，跟范戴克太太一样！{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:936
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_8413283f:

    # Emiel "{i}They must have been refurbished, though I’m surprised there’s enough money in the kitty for it. I don’t know if all that many people use this line...{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}肯定翻修过了。不过居然有钱翻修，倒让我挺意外。这条线，也不知道有没有多少人坐……{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:937
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_e936e047:

    # Emiel "{i}But what do I know? The train does go all the way to Utrecht, and I’ve heard the economy’s booming over in the cities!{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}嗐，我又懂什么呢？这车一路开到乌得勒支，听说城里的经济正红火着呢！{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:938
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_b975e3ca:

    # "My mother tutted at this, and told my father not to be so rude about Mrs van Dijk."
    "妈妈嗔怪地啧了一声，让爸爸别这么说范戴克太太。"

# chapter4.rpyc:939
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_2261b502:

    # Elowen g "{i}She might be old, but she’s hardly arthritic. She’s quite spry, actually, for her age. I’m sure she could defeat you in a fight, dear.{/i}"
    Elowen g "{i}她年纪是大了，可哪有你说的那么行动不便。到了这个年纪，她已经很利索了。真打起来，你肯定不是她的对手，亲爱的。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:940
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_1717e82d:

    # Emiel "{i}Hahaha. Well, you might be right about that. She’s a fierce old bird, isn’t she? I don’t know if I’d want to risk it.{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}哈哈哈，你说得也对。那位老太太可厉害了，我还真不一定敢惹她。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:941
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4ccc2f0b:

    # Emiel "{i}Even if she does have arthritis, I’m sure she could hit me over the head with that walking stick of hers! She’s as fierce as a warrior queen...{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}就算有关节炎，她肯定也能抡起拐杖敲我的脑袋！凶起来，活像个女战神……{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:942
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_ea6b5561:

    # Emiel "{i}But you’re fierce too, Nienke, dear. You’ll be going on a bit of a journey, but I’m sure everything will be fine.{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}不过，妮恩克，亲爱的，你也很厉害。这趟要走点远路，但我相信，一切都会好好的。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:943
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_cc9202e1:

    # Emiel "{i}I hope you have a good time — though I’m sure you’ll enjoy your journey more than your mother and I enjoyed going on this train all those years ago.{/i}"
    Emiel "{i}希望你一路玩得开心。不过，你这趟肯定比多年前我和你妈妈坐这车时开心多了。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:944
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_131ca605:

    # Elowen "{i}Well, I would hope so. Our last trip wasn’t very much fun. I’ve not wanted to step foot on a train since. There are too many bad memories...{/i}"
    Elowen "{i}但愿如此。我们上次可没什么好心情。从那以后，我都不想再踏上火车了。难过的回忆太多……{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:945
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_1f157b12:

    # Elowen "{i}But the train does look nicer than I remember — not that I remember too much.{/i}"
    Elowen "{i}不过，这车看起来确实比我记得的要好。虽说，我也没记住多少。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:946
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_56629996:

    # Elowen "{i}It’s all a bit of a blur.{/i}"
    Elowen "{i}一切都模模糊糊的。{/i}"

# chapter4.rpyc:947
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_3c8e02b4:

    # "My mother isn’t the only one who finds our last trip a blur, either."
    "对上一次旅程记忆模糊的，也不只有妈妈。"

# chapter4.rpyc:959
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4771575e:

    # "I’ve been racking my brain while sitting on the train, eating morsels of my sandwich (it’s egg and watercress), wondering if any bits and pieces of my past will surface to the forefront of my mind, but there’s nothing."
    "坐在车上，我吃着鸡蛋西洋菜三明治，绞尽脑汁地回想，想看看能不能找回一点过去的记忆。可什么也没有。"

# chapter4.rpyc:960
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_6d93504f:

    # "My father seemed especially impressed by the state of the trains, but I can’t share in his enthusiasm: not when I don’t remember the old ones."
    "爸爸对火车如今的模样尤其惊叹，可我没法跟他一样兴奋。毕竟，我不记得从前的样子。"

# chapter4.rpyc:961
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_48f630be:

    # "I don’t remember if the train groaned or creaked down the tracks, or if the leather of the seats was peeling, or if the smell of smoke hung in the air."
    "我不记得它在铁轨上行驶时，是不是吱嘎作响；不记得座椅的皮面有没有剥落，空气里有没有弥漫着烟味。"

# chapter4.rpyc:962
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_9f6906a0:

    # "It’s all been lost to me..."
    "这些，我全都忘了……"

# chapter4.rpyc:963
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_52c17526:

    # "But that’s alright."
    "不过，没关系。"

# chapter4.rpyc:964
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_781644a5:

    # "I don’t know if I want to remember my dim and distant past, when I was a young child suffering from a deadly illness."
    "我也不知道，自己究竟想不想记起那段模糊遥远的过去，记起那个身患重病、命悬一线的年幼的我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:965
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_a8761c68:

    # "I remembered the promise I made to Merel, and that’s enough."
    "我记起了与梅蕾尔的约定，这就够了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:966
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_66f3ddfb:

    # "I don’t want to think about what came after: the steady string of physicians, and my parents’ mounting concern, and their eventual, desperate flight from Mors Paravail."
    "我不想回想后来的事：一个接一个的医生，爸妈与日俱增的忧虑，还有最后那场近乎绝望的、逃离莫尔斯·帕拉维尔的旅程。"

# chapter4.rpyc:967
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_063190f3:

    # "I don’t want to remember if I boarded a train like this one, swaddled in my mother’s arms, or whether the shaking of the carriage around me made me feel sick."
    "我不想记起，自己是不是被妈妈裹在怀里，上了一趟这样的火车；也不想记起，车厢的颠簸有没有让我难受。"

# chapter4.rpyc:968
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_7a0a53ad:

    # "I’d rather my first real memory of riding a train be this one: me, sitting in a neat and clean carriage as I look out the window."
    "我宁愿，自己关于坐火车的第一个真切记忆，就是现在：坐在干净整洁的车厢里，望着窗外。"

# chapter4.rpyc:969
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_3d6fd204:

    # "Trees and fields pass me by, all a bright and verdant green. They’re very pretty, but my thoughts exist somewhere beyond the pastoral."
    "树木和田野从窗边掠过，满眼鲜亮的绿意。景色很美，可我的思绪早已越过乡野，飘向了更远的地方。"

# chapter4.rpyc:970
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_af83ae9b:

    # "I’m not just thinking of my surroundings, even if they are beautiful."
    "我想着的，不只是身边这些美丽的风景。"

# chapter4.rpyc:971
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4816c698:

    # "I’m thinking, too, of the future."
    "还有未来。"

# chapter4.rpyc:978
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_f84b2de1:

    # "I’ll be at Mors Paravail in about an hour."
    "再过一个小时左右，就到莫尔斯·帕拉维尔了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:979
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_8abb1681:

    # "I’ll alight from the train, my suitcase in hand (it’s a brand new suitcase my parents bought for my journey: walnut brown, with golden clasps), and then, I’ll see her again."
    "我会提着行李箱下车——爸妈为这趟旅程给我买的新箱子，胡桃棕色，配着金色搭扣——然后，就能再次见到她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:980
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_3a368cdb:

    # "She’ll be waiting for me on the platform, just like she promised she would."
    "她会在月台上等我，正如她答应的那样。"

# chapter4.rpyc:981
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_222e3106:

    # "It’s been eight months since I last saw her, but finally, we’ll be reunited again."
    "距离上次见面，已经过了八个月。终于，我们又能团聚了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:982
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_b05fddaa:

    # "I’m going to see Merel."
    "我要见到梅蕾尔了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:983
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_dfcb7078:

    # "The winter’s snow has long since melted, chased away by the sunlight, and now the fields and valleys are lush and full of life."
    "冬雪早已被阳光驱散，融化殆尽。如今，田野和山谷一片葱茏，生机盎然。"

# chapter4.rpyc:984
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_72cf43b1:

    # "Flowers are twined in the grass, pale and pastel, while golden daffodils slowly lift their head to greet the sunlight."
    "浅淡柔和的花朵点缀在草间，金黄的水仙缓缓抬起头，迎向阳光。"

# chapter4.rpyc:985
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_e46aacc2:

    # "The days are slowly beginning to lengthen and the weather is getting warmer."
    "白昼渐渐变长，天气也越来越暖。"

# chapter4.rpyc:986
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4d152c9c:

    # "The train was closed for a few weeks during the height of the winter, because there was too much snow heaped onto the tracks, but the trains are chugging along nicely now."
    "隆冬时，铁轨上积雪太厚，火车曾停开了几个星期。现在，它们又顺顺当当地跑起来了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:987
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_063e555a:

    # "There’s nothing to keep me apart from Merel. Willemijn is back at work (she’s been back for a while), and my parents have help enough at Fleur de Lys they said they could spare me for a week."
    "已经没有什么能阻止我去见梅蕾尔。威廉敏回来上班了，而且已经回来好一阵了。百合花咖啡馆人手够用，爸妈说，我可以离开一个星期。"

# chapter4.rpyc:988
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_a49e1102:

    # "I had to wait to see Merel because we were both busy — me, with the café, and Merel with some odd jobs around Mors Paravail — and the winter which ensued was especially frigid..."
    "之前一直没能见面，是因为我们都很忙：我要在咖啡馆帮忙，梅蕾尔则在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔做些零工。紧接着，又是一个格外寒冷的冬天……"

# chapter4.rpyc:989
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_6842521a:

    # "But, though we were parted from one another, we still wrote letters."
    "不过，虽然分隔两地，我们一直都在写信。"

# chapter4.rpyc:990
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_5ea73d2f:

    # "I wrote to her every week."
    "我每个星期都给她写。"

# chapter4.rpyc:991
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_834c77a9:

    # "Merel, as it transpires, is a much better correspondent than Cornelia."
    "事实证明，梅蕾尔比科妮莉娅更靠得住。"

# chapter4.rpyc:992
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_2ce2d06e:

    # "She always replied to me promptly, though her letters were a little too excitable: her hand slanted, rife with misspellings."
    "她总是很快就回信，字里行间兴奋得有点过头，笔迹歪歪斜斜，还夹着不少拼写错误。"

# chapter4.rpyc:993
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_79751423:

    # "Merel, as it turns out, is no great literati: not like Cornelia, with her writer father, who’s studying in Utrecht..."
    "看来，梅蕾尔并不是什么文人墨客。不像科妮莉娅，父亲是作家，自己又在乌得勒支求学……"

# chapter4.rpyc:994
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_8ec69646:

    # "But I don’t mind that. I’m glad that Merel found the time to write to me regardless."
    "但我不在乎。她愿意抽空写信给我，我就已经很高兴了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:995
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_b9e2fb63:

    # "Her letters don’t need to be masterpieces. They matter to me because they’re from her."
    "这些信不必是什么传世佳作。对我来说，重要的是，写信的人是她。"

# chapter4.rpyc:996
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_9894e1c9:

    # "I’ve cherished every single one of her letters, and I’ve been anticipating the day when we can see one another again."
    "每一封信，我都好好珍藏着，也一直盼着我们再次相见的那一天。"

# chapter4.rpyc:997
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_5dcfcd3c:

    # "Part of me worried my parents wouldn’t let me journey to Mors Paravail on my own, because I’ve never ventured too far from Alpenrose..."
    "我本来还有点担心，爸妈不会同意我独自去莫尔斯·帕拉维尔。毕竟，我从没离开阿尔彭罗瑟太远……"

# chapter4.rpyc:998
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4d2f0ff2:

    # "But, to my relief, they seemed to realise that I’m an adult now."
    "不过，让我松了口气的是，他们似乎终于意识到，我已经是个大人了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:999
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_f4abc153:

    # "I might be shorter and skinnier than other girls my age, thanks to my childhood illness, but my parents finally seem to realise they can’t keep me at home forever."
    "小时候的病，让我比同龄女孩更矮、更瘦。可爸妈似乎终于明白，他们不能把我一辈子留在家里。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1000
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_fd484fea:

    # "I’m not some delicate glass bauble which will shatter at the smallest of impacts."
    "我又不是一件轻轻一碰就会碎的玻璃摆设。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1001
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_b0986948:

    # "I had a brush with death as a child, but I’m older now."
    "小时候，我确实曾与死亡擦肩而过。可现在，我已经长大了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1002
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_1a142756:

    # "I wouldn’t exactly say that I’m hale and hearty (I have an annoying tendency to catch every cold that’s going around), but I’m old enough to go on a journey of my own."
    "要说身体强健，倒也算不上。每次闹感冒，总少不了我的份，实在烦人。但我已经大到可以独自出门旅行了。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1003
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_7975f557:

    # "I’m old enough to leave Alpenrose, and to visit Merel..."
    "我已经可以离开阿尔彭罗瑟，去看梅蕾尔……"

# chapter4.rpyc:1004
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_26f100df:

    # "And maybe, some day, I’ll leave Alpenrose for good. I’ll forge my own path in life, with Merel by my side."
    "也许有一天，我会彻底离开这里。在梅蕾尔的陪伴下，走出属于自己的人生。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1005
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_7f8cf194:

    # "I don’t know if I would want to stay in Mors Paravail, even if it is the home of us dark elves (Merel makes it sound quite gloomy in her letters), but there are many places I want to visit all across the Netherlands and beyond."
    "我不确定自己想不想住在莫尔斯·帕拉维尔。那里虽然是我们暗精灵的故乡，可梅蕾尔在信里把它说得挺阴沉。不过，荷兰境内，还有更远的地方，都有很多我想去看看的地方。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1006
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_d21c4d04:

    # "I’d like to visit Utrecht, since Cornelia has mentioned it so many times in her letters..."
    "我想去乌得勒支，毕竟科妮莉娅在信里提过那么多次……"

# chapter4.rpyc:1007
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_88476659:

    # "And I’d like to see Amsterdam too, and Rotterdam."
    "也想去看看阿姆斯特丹，还有鹿特丹。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1008
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_cc4b5725:

    # "I think it might be nice to leave the country altogether and take in even more of the sights, if I could: the Danube as it flows slowly through Austria, or the magisterial Swiss Alps..."
    "如果可以，干脆出国看看也不错：缓缓流过奥地利的多瑙河，或是瑞士雄伟的阿尔卑斯山……"

# chapter4.rpyc:1009
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_4b8f2b66:

    # "But I’m getting ahead of myself. I seem to be doing that a lot lately."
    "不过，我又想得太远了。最近好像总是这样。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1010
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_658b8707:

    # "I’ve been so excited about seeing Merel my thoughts keep skipping onwards, like stones, or shooting stars."
    "一想到要见梅蕾尔，我就兴奋得思绪停不下来，像打水漂的石子，又像划过天际的流星，不停地往前飞。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1011
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_df65a634:

    # "I keep thinking about the future I want, with Merel by my side..."
    "我总在想，我想要的未来，那个有她在身边的未来……"

# chapter4.rpyc:1012
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_5b2c6245:

    # "But first, I should focus on our reunion."
    "不过眼下，还是先想着这次重逢吧。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1013
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_33bda433:

    # "I’ve not seen her in months, but I’m not worried. I don’t feel self-conscious, even if I did spend longer than usual on my hair when I woke up this morning."
    "已经几个月没见她了，我却不担心，也不觉得局促。虽然今天早上起来，我确实比平时多花了点时间打理头发。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1014
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_e899f1a5:

    # "Our relationship survived a fifteen year absence already. Eight months is nothing."
    "我们的感情已经经受过十五年的分别。八个月，又算得了什么。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1015
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_9b66cb4c:

    # "We’ll see one another again, Merel’s smile illuminated by the sunshine, and it’ll be like nothing ever happened."
    "我们会再次相见，阳光照亮她的笑容，一切就像从未改变。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1016
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_06430dab:

    # "It’ll be like she never left me."
    "仿佛她从来没有离开过我。"

# chapter4.rpyc:1017
translate zh_CN_portable epilogue_15131d4d:

